        "attack": "被动<#ff9028ff>梦满枝<>：技能命中时附上<#ff9028ff>梦尘<>，<#ffb900ff>3秒<>内造成<#ffb900ff>5<>次<#a974ffff>4<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>3%<><#a974ffff>魔法伤害<>，对英雄另造成共5%最大生命值真实伤害并回复她<#6aff55ff>12<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#6aff55ff>8%<>生命。施法叠<#ff9028ff>腾跃<>，每层<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>移速+5%<>（最多<#ffb900ff>4<>层）。",
