      "league_rengar": {
        "name": "雷恩加尔",
        "attack": "<#ff9028ff>无形掠食者<>：复活、脱战<#ffb900ff>3秒<>或R后，下次攻击扑向目标造成<#ff9028ff>20<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>150%<>伤害。技能和扑击各得1点<#ff9028ff>残暴<>，满4点强化下个技能。<#ff9028ff>残忍无情<>（自动，<#ffb900ff>5秒<>）：攻击造成<#ff9028ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>90%<>伤害，攻速+40%；强化时<#ff9028ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>140%<>。<#ff9028ff>连招<>：空中Q、三Q。",
        "skill": "咆哮，对周围敌人造成<#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>50%<>伤害，回复<#66bb6aff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#66bb6aff>50%<>生命。<#ff9028ff>强化<>：回复200%，<#ffb900ff>1.5秒<>内<#ef5350ff>免疫控制<>。",
