        "attack": "<#ff9028ff>双生毒牙<>：甩出毒牙，造成<#a974ffff>18<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>14%<>魔法伤害；Q、W毒到敌人后<#ffb900ff>3秒<>内，多造成<#a974ffff>14<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>24%<>并<#66bb6aff>回复<><i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#66bb6aff>10%<>生命。<#ff9028ff>优雅蛇行<>：移速成长更高。",
