      "league_rammus": {
        "name": "拉莫斯",
        "attack": "翻身撞击。<#ff9028ff>锥刺甲壳<>：普攻多造成<#a974ffff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>30%<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#a974ffff>2%<>魔法伤害。<#ff9028ff>尖刺防御<>：敌方英雄靠近时蜷起来，<#ffb900ff>7秒<>内双抗+60%，反弹25%受到的伤害。",
