        "attack": "<#ff9028ff>狂雷渐起<>：攻击和技能叠攻速（每层6%，5层）；满层后攻击放出闪电，<#a974ffff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>40%<>魔法伤害。<#ff9028ff>暴怒撕咬<>：每<#ffb900ff>5秒<>攻击变成撕咬，造成<#ff9028ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>140%<>物理伤害并标记英雄，再咬时伤害+50%并回复<#66bb6aff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#66bb6aff>50%<>生命。",
