        "skill": "砸地裂出一道裂隙，造成<#ff9028ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<>物理伤害并<#ef5350ff>减速40%<>，尽头升起熔岩柱，持续<#ffb900ff>4秒<>。",
        "skill2": "冲向目标，造成<#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#ff9028ff>4%<>物理伤害。撞上熔岩柱时撞碎它，周围敌人<#ef5350ff>击飞<#ffb900ff>1秒<><>并受到<#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#ff9028ff>3%<>物理伤害，英雄易碎。",
        "ult": "召唤熔岩公羊从远处冲向自己，造成<#a974ffff>120<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#a974ffff>3%<>魔法伤害并<#ef5350ff>减速50%<>；公羊到身边时头槌把它顶回去，沿路造成<#a974ffff>120<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#a974ffff>3%<>魔法伤害并<#ef5350ff>击飞<>。"
      },
