        "skill": "斩击前方，造成<#ff9028ff>25<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>110%<>物理伤害；<#ffb900ff>4秒<>内下次普攻横扫周围，造成<#ff9028ff>25<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>110%<>物理伤害；魔龙形态再下次普攻撕咬，造成<#f5f5f5ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#f5f5f5ff>110%<>真实伤害。",
