        "attack": "<#ff9028ff>雙生毒牙<>：甩出毒牙，造成<#a974ffff>18<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>14%<>魔法傷害；Q、W毒到敵人後<#ffb900ff>3秒<>內，多造成<#a974ffff>14<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>24%<>並<#66bb6aff>回復<><i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#66bb6aff>10%<>生命。<#ff9028ff>致命節奏<>：移速成長更高。",
        "skill": "<#ffb900ff>0.4秒<>後在目標處炸開，敵人中毒<#ffb900ff>3秒<>，共受<#a974ffff>75<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<>魔法傷害；毒到英雄時她移速+45%，<#ffb900ff>3秒<>內漸退。",
