      "league_janna": {
        "name": "Janna",
        "attack": "Basic attacks blow a gust of wind that deals <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. Passive <#ff9028ff>Tailwind<>: in combat, she and nearby allied champions gain <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>8% Move Speed<>.",
        "skill": "Janna sends a tornado down a line, dealing <#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> to enemies in its path and <#ef5350ff>knocking them up<> for <#ffb900ff>0.75s<>.",
        "skill2": "<#ff9028ff>Zephyr<> strikes an enemy champion for <#a974ffff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>40% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and <#ef5350ff>slows<> it by 30% for <#ffb900ff>2s<>. <#ff9028ff>Eye of the Storm<> gives a nearby allied champion a <#e8d44dff>150<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>75% Ability Power<> <#e8d44dff>shield<> for <#ffb900ff>4s<>; while it holds they gain <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>15% Attack<>. With no ally nearby she shields herself.",
        "ult": "Janna knocks nearby enemies back, then channels for <#ffb900ff>3s<>, healing nearby allied champions (herself included) for <#6aff55ff>130<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50% Ability Power<> <#6aff55ff>health<> each second, <#ffb900ff>4<> times. Crowd control or death ends it."
      },
      "league_malphite": {
        "name": "Malphite",
        "attack": "Malphite pounds with his stone fists for <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. Passive <#ff9028ff>Granite Shield<>: a <#e8d44dff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60% Ability Power<> <#e8d44dff>shield<> that comes back <#ffb900ff>10s<> after it breaks. <#ff9028ff>Thunderclap<>: <#ffb900ff>10%<> more <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:armor_0><#ffdd8eff>armor<>, <#ffb900ff>20%<> while the shield holds.",
        "skill": "Malphite hurls a shard of the earth at an enemy, dealing <#a974ffff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and <#ef5350ff>slowing<> it by <#ffb900ff>25%<> for <#ffb900ff>3s<>. He steals that speed: <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>25% Move Speed<> for <#ffb900ff>3s<>.",
        "skill2": "Malphite slams the ground, dealing <#a974ffff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>40% Ability Power<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#6aff55ff>2% of his max health<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> to nearby enemies and cutting their <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:attack_speed_0><#ceff99ff>attack speed<> by <#ffb900ff>20%<> for <#ffb900ff>3s<>. Then <#ff9028ff>Thunderclap<>: for <#ffb900ff>4s<> his basic attacks also deal <#ff9028ff>10<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#6aff55ff>1% of his max health<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> to the enemies in a cone ahead.",
        "ult": "Malphite charges at an enemy champion, immune to crowd control on the way. On landing he deals <#a974ffff>150<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60% Ability Power<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#6aff55ff>3% of his max health<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> to the enemies around him and <#ef5350ff>knocks them up<> for <#ffb900ff>1.25s<>."
      },
      "league_ekko": {
        "name": "Ekko",
        "attack": "Basic attacks deal <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. Passive <#ff9028ff>Z-Drive Resonance<>: basic attacks, each pass of Q, E's strike and R's blast add a stack; the <#ffb900ff>3rd<> deals an extra <#a974ffff>100<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and <#ef5350ff>slows<> by 40% for <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>; then no stacks for <#ffb900ff>3s<>. With an enemy champion nearby, Ekko gains <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>40% Move Speed<> for <#ffb900ff>2s<>.",
        "skill": "Ekko throws a device that deals <#a974ffff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> to enemies in its path. At the end it expands into a field that <#ef5350ff>slows<> enemies inside by 40% for <#ffb900ff>0.75s<>, then rewinds to Ekko, dealing <#a974ffff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> on the way back.",
        "skill2": "Ekko dashes to his target and strikes for <#a974ffff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>. <#ff9028ff>Parallel Convergence<> (every <#ffb900ff>14s<>): a time sphere forms under a nearby enemy champion after <#ffb900ff>1.5s<> and <#ef5350ff>slows<> by 40% for <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>; with Ekko inside it bursts, <#ef5350ff>stunning<> enemies in it for <#ffb900ff>1s<> and giving Ekko a <#e8d44dff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80% Ability Power<> <#e8d44dff>shield<> for <#ffb900ff>2s<>.",
        "ult": "Ekko leaves a time anchor at his feet. <#ffb900ff>4s<> later he snaps back to it, briefly invulnerable, heals <#6aff55ff>150<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80% Ability Power<> <#6aff55ff>health<> and deals <#a974ffff>150<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>100% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> to enemies around his arrival point. No rewind if he dies first."
      },
      "league_yone": {
        "name": "Yone",
        "attack": "Basic attacks deal <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. Passive <#ff9028ff>Way of the Hunter<>: <#ffb900ff>20%<> critical strike chance; crits deal double damage. Every second attack strikes with the demon blade for <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>50% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> and <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>40% AD<> <#f5f5f5ff>true damage<>.",
        "skill": "Thrusts forward, dealing <#ff9028ff>25<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> to enemies in a line. It is treated as a basic attack and can critically strike. On hit Yone gains a stack of <#ff9028ff>Gathering Storm<>; at <#ffb900ff>2<> stacks the next cast dashes him forward with a gust of wind that <#ef5350ff>knocks up<> enemies in its path for <#ffb900ff>1s<>.",
        "skill2": "Cleaves a cone for <#ff9028ff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>25% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> and <#f5f5f5ff>10<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>15% AD<> <#f5f5f5ff>true damage<> (champions also take <#f5f5f5ff>5% of their max health<>); each champion hit shields Yone for <#e8d44dff>35<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>35% AD<>. Every <#ffb900ff>15s<> it opens with <#ff9028ff>Soul Unbound<>: his spirit dashes at a champion, returns <#ffb900ff>4s<> later and repeats <#ffb900ff>25%<> of its damage to champions as <#f5f5f5ff>true damage<>.",
        "ult": "Strikes all enemies in a line for <#ff9028ff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>50% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> and <#f5f5f5ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>35% AD<> <#f5f5f5ff>true damage<> and <#ef5350ff>knocks them up<> for <#ffb900ff>0.75s<>; Yone appears behind his target. <#ff9028ff>Combo Q3 R<>: within <#ffb900ff>1.5s<> of Q3 knocking up a champion it cuts at once, without the wind-up; a champion hit adds a Mortal Steel stack (<#ff9028ff>R Q3<>)."
      },
      "league_ezreal": {
        "name": "Ezreal",
        "attack": "Basic attacks deal <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. Passive <#ff9028ff>Rising Spell Force<>: each target his abilities hit grants <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:attack_speed_0><#ceff99ff>12% attack speed<> for <#ffb900ff>6s<>, stacking up to <#ffb900ff>5<> times; a new hit refreshes it.",
        "skill": "A bolt deals <#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>140% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> to the first enemy hit (a basic attack: it can crit); on hit, all cooldowns drop to at most <#ffb900ff>2/3<> of their length. <#ff9028ff>Essence Flux<> (every <#ffb900ff>6s<>): first an orb sticks to a nearby enemy champion for <#ffb900ff>4s<>; his next attack or ability on an enemy champion detonates it for <#ff9028ff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>90% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>.",
        "skill2": "In a fight: with an enemy champion close, Ezreal blinks away from it; with his target out of attack range, he blinks toward it. Then he fires a homing bolt for <#ff9028ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>50% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. The bolt also detonates <#ff9028ff>Essence Flux<>.",
        "ult": "After a <#ffb900ff>1s<> charge, fires a long-range energy wave that deals <#ff9028ff>250<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>130% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> to enemy champions in its path; minions and monsters take half."
      },
      "league_thresh": {
        "name": "Thresh",
        "attack": "Thresh lashes his chain for <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. Passive <#ff9028ff>Flay<>: after <#ffb900ff>2s<> without attacking, his next attack deals <#a974ffff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50% Ability Power<> bonus <#a974ffff>magic damage<>. <#ff9028ff>Damnation<>: the souls he reaps become his Armor and Ability Power growth.",
        "skill": "Thresh throws his scythe at the first enemy champion in a line (it passes minions), dealing <#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, <#ef5350ff>stunning<> it for <#ffb900ff>1s<> and pulling it to him. <#ff9028ff>Dark Passage<>: every <#ffb900ff>14s<> he also throws his lantern, giving himself and a nearby allied champion a <#e8d44dff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>40% Ability Power<> <#e8d44dff>shield<> for <#ffb900ff>2.5s<>.",
        "skill2": "Thresh sweeps his chain around him, dealing <#a974ffff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>40% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> to enemies and <#ef5350ff>slowing<> them by 40% for <#ffb900ff>1s<>. With an enemy champion right on him he <#ef5350ff>knocks them away<>; otherwise, and always right after a hook, he <#ef5350ff>pulls them toward and past him<>.",
        "ult": "Thresh raises a prison of spectral walls where he stands for <#ffb900ff>5s<>. The first enemy champion to touch it takes <#a974ffff>150<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and is <#ef5350ff>slowed<> by 99% for <#ffb900ff>2s<>; later ones take no damage and are slowed for half as long."
