      "league_kennen": {
        "name": "Kennen",
        "attack": "Throws shurikens. Passive <#ff9028ff>Mark of the Storm<>: his abilities mark the champions they hit; the third mark <#ef5350ff>stuns for 1.25s<> (0.5s if stunned within 7s). <#ff9028ff>Electrical Surge<>: every fifth attack deals <#a974ffff>48<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70% AP<> bonus <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and marks.",
        "skill": "Kennen hurls a shuriken (the aim is set before it leaves, so it can be dodged): the first enemy hit takes <#a974ffff>95<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>90% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>. If it hits a champion while <#ff9028ff>Electrical Surge<> is ready, he surges at once (combo).",
        "skill2": "Kennen turns into lightning and rushes through enemies, dealing <#a974ffff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70% AP<> to each one he passes; at the end he releases <#ff9028ff>Electrical Surge<> (<#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80% AP<> around him) and gains 50% attack speed for <#ffb900ff>4s<>. With his ultimate ready he goes straight into it (combo).",
        "ult": "Kennen summons a storm that follows him for <#ffb900ff>3s<>, striking enemy champions inside it every 0.5s for <#a974ffff>52<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>30% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and a mark; he gains 25 armor and magic resist meanwhile."
      },
      "league_jhin": {
        "name": "Jhin",
        "attack": "Passive <#ff9028ff>Whisper<>: four shots a round; the fourth always <#ff9028ff>crits<> and adds <#ffb900ff>10%<> of the target's max health, then Jhin reloads for <#ffb900ff>2.17s<> (he can move and cast meanwhile) and gains <#ffb900ff>25%<> move speed. Champions he kills bloom a lotus where they fall.",
        "skill": "Jhin throws a grenade that bounces from its target to the enemies behind it, up to <#ffb900ff>4<> hits, each dealing <#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>70%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>; every unit it kills adds <#ffb900ff>35%<> to the hits after it.",
        "skill2": "With <#ff9028ff>Captive Audience<> ready, Jhin first plants a lotus at an enemy champion's feet: stepped on, it <#ef5350ff>slows by 35%<> and bursts <#ffb900ff>2s<> later for <#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>120%<>. Then he fires a very long shot: the first enemy champion hit takes <#ff9028ff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>90%<> and is <#ef5350ff>rooted for 1.67s<> if Jhin's team damaged him lately.",
        "ult": "Jhin sets up and fires <#ffb900ff>4<> very long shots, each aimed before it leaves (crowd control breaks the channel): the first enemy champion in its path takes <#ff9028ff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>55%<> and is <#ef5350ff>slowed by 80%<>; every hit adds <#ffb900ff>30%<> to the shots after it, and the fourth deals double."
      },
      "league_zilean": {
        "name": "Zilean",
        "attack": "Fires time orbs. Passive <#ff9028ff>Time In A Bottle<>: every <#ffb900ff>90s<> a bottle fills; his next <#ff9028ff>Time Warp<> on an allied champion hands it over: that ally and Zilean each gain <#ff9028ff>10 attack<>, <#a974ffff>10 AP<> and <#6aff55ff>80 health<> until they die.",
        "skill": "Zilean lobs a bomb at the target's feet (aimed on release: dodgeable). It sticks to the first enemy near it (champions first) and explodes after <#ffb900ff>3s<> for <#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>. <#ff9028ff>Rewind<> (every <#ffb900ff>12s<>): on a champion he turns time back and throws another - both explode at once and <#ef5350ff>stun for 1.25s<>; cooldowns shorten.",
        "skill2": "Zilean <#ef5350ff>slows<> an enemy champion by <#ef5350ff>35%<> and grants an allied champion beside him (himself if alone) <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>35% move speed<> for <#ffb900ff>2.5s<>.",
        "ult": "When an allied champion near him is crowd-controlled, or two enemy champions close in on Zilean, he places a time rune on them: they cannot die for <#ffb900ff>5s<>, then time rewinds and they heal <#6aff55ff>400<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#6aff55ff>150% AP<>."
      },
      "league_vi": {
        "name": "Vi",
        "attack": "Basic attacks deal <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. <#ff9028ff>Denting Blows<>: every 3rd attack deals <#ff9028ff>20<> more (+<#ff9028ff>5% max health<> to champions), shreds <#ffb900ff>20%<> armour and gives <#ffb900ff>+30%<> attack speed for <#ffb900ff>4s<>. <#ff9028ff>Blast Shield<>: a spell hit shields her for <#ffb900ff>100<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ffb900ff>60% AD<> (<#ffb900ff>3s<>, <#ffb900ff>12s<> cooldown, <#ffb900ff>-3s<> per 3rd attack).",
        "skill": "Vi charges for <#ffb900ff>0.5s<> (the aim locks as she starts), then dashes ahead dealing <#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> to enemies on the way; the first champion stops her and is knocked back (a Denting Blows stack). For <#ffb900ff>1.5s<> after, Relentless Force punches at once.",
        "skill2": "<#ffb900ff>2<> charges (<#ffb900ff>8s<> each). Her next attack becomes Relentless Force: <#ff9028ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>110% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> to the target and enemies in a cone behind it.",
        "ult": "Vi targets an enemy champion and charges, immune to crowd control; enemies in the way take <#ff9028ff>75<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> and are stunned <#ffb900ff>0.75s<>. On arrival the target is knocked up <#ffb900ff>1.25s<> for <#ff9028ff>150<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>120% AD<>; her next attack is a Relentless Force."
      },
      "league_kayn": {
        "name": "Kayn",
        "attack": "Basic attacks deal <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. <#ff9028ff>Darkin Scythe<>: <#fffffffe><>spell hits on nearby champions charge the <#fe5c50ff>Darkin<> (<#ffb900ff>2<>), W hits only on far ones the <#8484fbff>Shadow<> (<#ffb900ff>1<>); the first full one is his form until death<#ffffffff><>. <#fe5c50ff>Darkin<>: heals <#ffb900ff>20%<> of damage to champions. <#8484fbff>Shadow<>: for <#ffb900ff>3s<> into a fight, hits on champions deal <#ffb900ff>8<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ffb900ff>15%<> true damage more.",
        "skill": "Kayn dashes at the target and spins his scythe; the dash and the spin each deal <#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>55% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> (<#fe5c50ff>Darkin<>: +<#ff9028ff>4% max health<> to champions). <#ff9028ff>Shadow Step<>: then <#ffb900ff>+35%<> move speed (<#8484fbff>Shadow<> <#ffb900ff>+55%<>) for <#ffb900ff>2s<> and heals <#ffb900ff>20<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ffb900ff>20%<>.",
        "skill2": "Kayn raises his scythe for <#ffb900ff>0.55s<> (the aim locks as he raises it), then slashes a line ahead: <#ff9028ff>55<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> and a decaying <#ffb900ff>50%<> slow. <#fe5c50ff>Darkin<>: knocks up for <#ffb900ff>0.75s<>. <#8484fbff>Shadow<>: longer reach.",
        "ult": "Kayn infests an enemy champion his team damaged recently, untargetable for <#ffb900ff>2s<>, then bursts out for <#ff9028ff>110<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>150% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. <#fe5c50ff>Darkin<>: +<#ff9028ff>10% max health<>, healing <#ffb900ff>70%<> of it. <#8484fbff>Shadow<>: his fight-start bonus opens again."
      },
      "league_aatrox": {
        "name": "Aatrox",
        "attack": "Passive <#ff9028ff>Deathbringer Stance<>: every <#ffb900ff>10s<> an attack deals <#ffb900ff>25<> more and <#ffb900ff>6%<> of a champion's max health and <#4caf50ff>heals<> him; each hit on a champion takes 2s off the wait, an edge hit 4s. He <#4caf50ff>heals 18%<> of the damage he deals to champions.",
        "skill": "Aatrox slams his greatsword up to three times, each with a new shape and +<#ffb900ff>25%<> damage: <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>176%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>; enemies hit by the edge take <#ffb900ff>60%<> more and are <#ef5350ff>knocked up<>. With <#ff9028ff>Umbral Dash<> ready he first dashes to put a champion on the edge.",
        "skill2": "Aatrox fires a chain: the first enemy hit takes <#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>40%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>; a champion it hits is chained: <#ffb900ff>1.5s<> later it is <#ef5350ff>pulled back<> and hit again.",
        "ult": "Aatrox reveals his demonic form for <#ffb900ff>10s<>: nearby minions and monsters are <#ef5350ff>feared<>, he gains <#ffb900ff>25%<> attack damage, <#4caf50ff>50%<> more self-healing and <#ffb900ff>45%<> move speed that decays. Champion kills refresh it."
      },
      "league_sivir": {
        "name": "Sivir",
        "attack": "Passive <#ff9028ff>Fleet of Foot<>: hitting a champion with an attack or a spell gives <#ffb900ff>25%<> move speed, fading over 2s. <#ff9028ff>Ricochet<>: every <#ffb900ff>10s<> her next attack starts <#ffb900ff>4s<> of Ricochet: +<#ffb900ff>45%<> attack speed, and each attack also bounces to up to <#ffb900ff>3<> enemies behind its target for <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60%<> physical damage (can crit).",
        "skill": "Sivir hurls her crossblade: it flies to the end of its path and back to her hand, dealing <#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>80%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> to every enemy it cuts through on both passes. With a champion in reach she throws it where he stands (aimed before it leaves: it can be dodged).",
        "skill2": "Sivir raises a spell shield for up to <#ffb900ff>3s<>: <#ef5350ff>immune to spell damage and crowd control<>. The first hit she takes heals her for <#7ed957ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#7ed957ff>40%<> and triggers Fleet of Foot; the shield breaks <#ffb900ff>1s<> later.",
        "ult": "Nearby allied champions, Sivir included, gain <#ffb900ff>30%<> move speed for <#ffb900ff>8s<>. While she hunts, her attacks that hit champions take time off Boomerang Blade and Spell Shield, Ricochet comes back twice as fast, and a champion her attack kills renews the hunt."
      },
      "league_twistedfate": {
        "name": "Twisted Fate",
        "attack": "Throws cards. Passive <#ff9028ff>Loaded Dice<>: a unit killed by his attack or Wild Cards rolls a die, the face giving a little <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>Ability Power<> until he dies. <#ff9028ff>Stacked Deck<>: every 4th attack deals <#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<> bonus <#a974ffff>magic damage<>.",
        "skill": "Twisted Fate throws three cards, dealing <#a974ffff>120<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>100%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> to each enemy they pass through. The aim is set as he throws, so they can be dodged.",
        "skill2": "Blue, red and gold cards cycle over his head; he locks the one he wants as it comes up and his next attack throws it (plus <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<>): <#ff9028ff>Blue<> <#a974ffff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>100%<> and halves his spell cooldowns; <#ff9028ff>Red<> <#a974ffff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70%<> around the target and <#ef5350ff>slows<>; <#ff9028ff>Gold<> <#a974ffff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<> and <#ef5350ff>stuns<> for <#ffb900ff>1.67s<>.",
        "ult": "<#ff9028ff>Destiny<>: every enemy champion is marked. <#ff9028ff>Gate<>: after a <#ffb900ff>1.5s<> channel (crowd control breaks it) he teleports beside a distant enemy champion his team is fighting and lands with a <#ff9028ff>Gold Card<> locked. Used only when no enemy is near him."
      },
      "league_rakan": {
        "name": "Rakan",
        "attack": "Throws a feather. Passive <#ff9028ff>Fey Feathers<>: Rakan holds a <#e8d44dff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#e8d44dff>70% AP<> <#e8d44dff>shield<>; <#ffb900ff>12s<> after it breaks it comes back, <#ffb900ff>1s<> sooner for every attack or ability that hits an enemy champion.",
        "skill": "Rakan flings a feather: the first enemy hit takes <#a974ffff>100<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>. After a champion hit he <#6aff55ff>heals<> himself and nearby allied champions for <#6aff55ff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#6aff55ff>50% AP<> after <#ffb900ff>3s<>, or as soon as he touches an ally.",
        "skill2": "<#ff9028ff>Grand Entrance<>: Rakan dashes onto an enemy champion and spirals up, <#ef5350ff>knocking up<> the enemies around him for <#ffb900ff>0.8s<> and dealing <#a974ffff>100<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>; then <#ff9028ff>Battle Dance<>: he flies to the nearest allied champion and gives him a <#e8d44dff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#e8d44dff>70% AP<> <#e8d44dff>shield<> for <#ffb900ff>3s<>. With Xayah near he flies farther.",
        "ult": "For <#ffb900ff>4s<> Rakan <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>darts<> through the enemy team: every enemy he touches takes <#a974ffff>140<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70% AP<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and is <#ef5350ff>charmed for 1.25s<> (once each). The first champion he touches speeds him up."
      },
      "league_evelynn": {
        "name": "Evelynn",
        "attack": "Lashes. <#ff9028ff>Demon Shade<>: after <#ffb900ff>4s<> without attacks or spells (Allure excepted) she regenerates and, from level 5, is camouflaged. <#ff9028ff>Whiplash<>: every <#ffb900ff>8s<> her attack whips for <#a974ffff>40<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>40%<> and <#ffffffff>3%<> max health and speeds her up; out of the Shade it dashes to the target, hitting all in between.",
        "skill": "Her lasher hits the first enemy for <#a974ffff>45<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>35%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and her next 3 attacks deal <#a974ffff>15<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>20%<> more. Then 3 spikes fire by themselves (champions first), each dealing <#a974ffff>30<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>25%<> to the enemies on its line.",
        "skill2": "Marks an enemy (champions first) without breaking her Shade. After <#ffb900ff>2.5s<> her next hit <#ef5350ff>charms<> it: champions <#ffb900ff>1.25s<> and <#a974ffff>-35% magic resist<>, monsters <#ffb900ff>3s<> and <#a974ffff>150<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<>.",
        "ult": "Readied, cast once she has hit champions a few times or is surrounded: a cone of <#a974ffff>150<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>75%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, +<#ffb900ff>35%<> for each recent champion hit (up to x2.4); she is <#ef5350ff>untargetable<>, warps back and soon returns to the Shade."
      },
      "league_sett": {
        "name": "Sett",
        "attack": "Passive <#ff9028ff>Pit Grit<>: Sett's punches alternate left and right. The right punch lands sooner and deals <#ff9028ff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>20% AD<> more <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>; after <#ffb900ff>2s<> without a punch he starts again with the left. He has high <#6aff55ff>health regeneration<>.",
        "skill": "Sett pulls in every enemy around him for <#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>70% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>: two or more are <#ef5350ff>stunned<> for <#ffb900ff>1s<>, one is <#ef5350ff>slowed<> by <#ffb900ff>50%<>. His next two punches (<#ff9028ff>Knuckle Down<>) deal <#ff9028ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>20% AD<> + <#ffb900ff>4%<> of the target's max health more and he gains <#ffb900ff>30%<> move speed. For <#ffb900ff>1.5s<> after it <#ef5350ff>stuns<> a champion, Haymaker's whole fist deals <#f5f5f5ff>true damage<>.",
        "skill2": "Passive: Sett gains a level of <#e8d44dff>Grit<> while taking damage (up to <#ffb900ff>5<>, lost after <#ffb900ff>4s<>). He spends it on a <#e8d44dff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#e8d44dff>20% AD<> <#e8d44dff>shield<> and winds up a punch: <#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>70% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>; enemies in the middle also take <#f5f5f5ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#f5f5f5ff>30% AD<> <#f5f5f5ff>true damage<>. Each level of Grit adds <#e8d44dff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#e8d44dff>25% AD<> shield and <#f5f5f5ff>10<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#f5f5f5ff>8% AD<> true damage.",
        "ult": "Sett grabs an enemy champion (<#ef5350ff>stunned<>), hurls it and slams down on it: enemies nearby take <#ff9028ff>120<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> + <#ffb900ff>4%<> of their max health as <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> and are <#ef5350ff>slowed<> by <#ffb900ff>99%<> for <#ffb900ff>0.5s<>; the thrown one takes <#ffb900ff>6%<> of its max health more. For <#ffb900ff>2.5s<> after the slam, Facebreaker always <#ef5350ff>stuns<> and Haymaker's whole fist deals <#f5f5f5ff>true damage<>."
      },
      "league_lissandra": {
        "name": "Lissandra",
        "attack": "Throws ice bolts. Passive <#ff9028ff>Iceborn Subjugation<>: an enemy champion she kills becomes a frozen thrall that shatters after <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>, dealing <#a974ffff>150<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> around it and <#ef5350ff>slowing<>.",
        "skill": "Throws a shard of ice that deals <#a974ffff>120<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>100%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> to every enemy it passes and <#ef5350ff>slows<> them by 25%. The aim is set as she throws, so it can be dodged.",
        "skill2": "<#ff9028ff>Ring of Frost<>: enemies around her take <#a974ffff>100<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and are <#ef5350ff>rooted<> for <#ffb900ff>1.25s<>. With no enemy near, <#ff9028ff>Glacial Path<> first: a claw dealing <#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<>; she blinks after it to an enemy champion her team is fighting and casts the ring there.",
        "ult": "Encases an enemy champion: <#ef5350ff>stunned<> for <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>, <#a974ffff>200<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>100%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>. Surrounded by two or more enemy champions, she encases herself instead for <#ffb900ff>2.5s<>: immune to damage and crowd control, healing <#7cfc00ff>200<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#7cfc00ff>80%<>. The ice leaves a slowing field around the tomb."
      },
      "league_alistar": {
        "name": "Alistar",
        "attack": "Pounds with both fists. Passive <#ff9028ff>Triumphant Roar<>: after his crowd control lands on enemy champions <#ffb900ff>3 times<> he roars, healing himself <#7cfc00ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#7cfc00ff>20%<> and allied champions nearby <#7cfc00ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#7cfc00ff>30%<>.",
        "skill": "<#ff9028ff>Trample<> into <#ff9028ff>Pulverize<>: he tramples for <#ffb900ff>3s<> (<#a974ffff>12<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>9%<> a stomp), then smashes the ground: <#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and a <#ef5350ff>1s knock-up<> around him. After <#ffb900ff>5<> stomps on champions his next attack <#ef5350ff>stuns<> for 1s.",
        "skill2": "<#ff9028ff>Headbutt<> into <#ff9028ff>Pulverize<>: charges an enemy champion, knocks him back for <#a974ffff>100<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>110%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, then smashes the ground, <#ef5350ff>knocking up<> enemies around him. Starts Trample too. (shares Pulverize: one slam every 6 s)",
        "ult": "Roars in a fight: <#ef5350ff>immune to crowd control<> for <#ffb900ff>1s<>, takes <#ffb900ff>50%<> less damage for <#ffb900ff>7s<>."
      },
      "league_varus": {
        "name": "Varus",
        "attack": "Shoots arrows dealing <#a974ffff>20 magic damage<> on hit; each champion hit adds a stack of <#ff9028ff>Blight<> (up to 3). Passive <#ff9028ff>Living Vengeance<>: a champion kill gives <#ffb900ff>+60%<> attack speed, a minion or monster kill <#ffb900ff>+20%<>, for 5s.",
        "skill": "Draws and fires a piercing arrow: fully charged with an enemy champion in reach for <#ff9028ff>110<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>130%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>, else a quick weaker shot; each further enemy takes less. A champion hit bursts Blight: <#ffffffff>3% max health<> true damage per stack and shorter cooldowns. Every 40s a full draw adds <#ffffffff>6%<>.",
        "skill2": "Rains arrows on an area: <#ff9028ff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>90%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>, bursting Blight. The ground stays corrupted for <#ffb900ff>4s<>: enemies in it are <#ef5350ff>slowed<> by 30% and healed 40% less.",
        "ult": "Flings a tendril at the first enemy champion: <#ff9028ff>150<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>80%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>, <#ef5350ff>rooted<> for <#ffb900ff>2s<>, full Blight. The corruption then spreads to enemy champions nearby, <#ef5350ff>rooting<> them for <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>."
      },
      "league_tryndamere": {
        "name": "Tryndamere",
        "attack": "Sword strikes. Passive <#ff9028ff>Battle Fury<>: each enemy his attacks and Spinning Slash hit gives a stack of Fury, a kill two, up to 5; each stack is <#ffb900ff>+8%<> critical strike chance (crits deal double). Fury drains a stack a second once he stops for 5s.",
        "skill": "Spins through the target, dealing <#ff9028ff>100<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>160%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> to every enemy in his path and gaining a stack of Fury for each.",
        "skill2": "Mocks the enemy champions around him: <#ef5350ff>-25%<> attack for <#ffb900ff>4s<>. Those farther off, turning to run, are also <#ef5350ff>slowed<> by 40% for 2s.",
        "ult": "When two enemy champions are on him or the blows keep coming: full Fury, and for <#ffb900ff>5s<> his health cannot fall below 1. As it ends he casts <#ff9028ff>Bloodlust<>, spending his Fury to heal <#66bb6aff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#66bb6aff>30%<>, plus <#66bb6aff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#66bb6aff>10%<> per stack."
      },
      "league_xerath": {
        "name": "Xerath",
        "attack": "Fires arcane orbs. Passive <#ff9028ff>Mana Surge<>: every <#ffb900ff>14s<> his next attack deals <#a974ffff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>40%<> bonus <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and cuts his basic spells' cooldowns by 23%. Each unit he kills brings it 3.5s sooner.",
        "skill": "Charges, then fires a piercing beam: <#a974ffff>110<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>85%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> to every enemy in the line. With an enemy champion near he charges fully for a longer beam; against minions alone a quick charge deals 65%.",
        "skill2": "<#ff9028ff>Shocking Orb<>: the first enemy hit takes <#a974ffff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>45%<> and is <#ef5350ff>stunned<> for 0.75-2s (longer the farther it flew). Then the <#ff9028ff>Eye of Destruction<> falls on the enemy champion: <#a974ffff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50%<> and a <#ef5350ff>slow<>, +67% in the centre.",
        "ult": "Ascends and channels in place, calling <#ffb900ff>4<> arcane shells down on distant enemy champions. Each lands after a warning for <#a974ffff>120<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>45%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>; every champion hit adds 20% to the shells after it. Crowd control breaks the channel."
      },
      "league_xinzhao": {
        "name": "Xin Zhao",
        "attack": "Spear thrusts. Passive <#ff9028ff>Determination<>: every third attack deals <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>40%<> more physical damage and heals him <#66bb6aff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#66bb6aff>15%<>.",
        "skill": "Charges the target, dealing <#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>50%<> physical damage to nearby enemies and <#ef5350ff>slowing<> them by 30%; he gains 40% attack speed for <#ffb900ff>5s<>. Then <#ff9028ff>Three Talon Strike<>: his next 3 attacks deal <#ff9028ff>20<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>30%<> more, the third <#ef5350ff>knocks up<> for 0.75s.",
        "skill2": "Slashes in front of him for <#ff9028ff>20<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>40%<> physical damage, then thrusts ahead for <#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>65%<> physical damage, <#ef5350ff>slowing<> by 50% for 1.5s.",
        "ult": "Sweeps around him for <#ff9028ff>100<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<> plus 10% of the target's max health as physical damage, <#ef5350ff>knocking back<> every enemy but the challenged one. For <#ffb900ff>3s<> afterwards he takes 40% less damage."
      },
      "league_samira": {
        "name": "Samira",
        "attack": "Shoots from range; in melee range she slashes for <#a974ffff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#a974ffff>20%<> bonus <#a974ffff>magic damage<>. Passive <#ff9028ff>Daredevil Impulse<>: a champion hit by a move unlike her last raises her Style a grade, E to S, +3% move speed each; it resets after 9s without one. Attacking a champion in crowd control dashes her to it and <#ef5350ff>knock it up<> for 0.5s.",
        "skill": "With an enemy beside her she slashes in front of her, otherwise she shoots the first enemy in line: <#ff9028ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>130%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>.",
        "skill2": "<#ff9028ff>Wild Rush<>: dashes past an enemy champion, dealing <#a974ffff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#a974ffff>40%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> around her and gaining 30% attack speed. Then <#ff9028ff>Blade Whirl<>: spins for 0.75s, slashing twice for <#ff9028ff>25<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>70%<> each and taking 60% less damage from attacks. A champion kill refreshes the cooldown.",
        "ult": "Only at Style <#ffb900ff>S<>: spins in place firing for <#ffb900ff>2s<>, every 0.2s a shot at every enemy around her for <#ff9028ff>10<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>40%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>, with 40% life steal. Spends her Style."
      },
      "league_pyke": {
        "name": "Pyke",
        "attack": "Harpoon slashes. Passive <#ff9028ff>Gift of the Drowned Ones<>: hits store grey health (up to 5 stacks); camouflaged or unhit for 3s he heals <#66bb6aff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#66bb6aff>8%<> <#66bb6aff>health<> a stack. Little health growth, more attack damage growth.",
        "skill": "Stabs a champion beside him, otherwise charges and throws his harpoon at the first enemy: <#ff9028ff>35<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>, a 90% slow, and the harpoon <#ef5350ff>pulls<> it to him.",
        "skill2": "<#ff9028ff>Ghostwater Dive<>: camouflage and a burst of speed, grey health healed. Then <#ff9028ff>Phantom Undertow<>: dashes through an enemy champion; a phantom rushes back to him, dealing <#ff9028ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> to champions on its way and <#ef5350ff>stunning<> them for 1s.",
        "ult": "Strikes an X: champions take <#ffffffff>180<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ffffffff>60%<> <#ffffffff>true damage<> - below that they are <#ef5350ff>executed<>, otherwise they take half; other enemies take half as physical damage. A champion dying in the X blinks him to it and <#ffb900ff>refreshes the ult<>."
      },
      "league_gwen": {
        "name": "Gwen",
        "attack": "Passive <#ff9028ff>A Thousand Cuts<>: her attacks and skill hits deal <#a974ffff>10<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>8%<> bonus <#a974ffff>magic damage<>; to champions also <#f5f5f5ff>1% max health true damage<>, healing her <#a974ffff>10<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>6%<>. Each attack adds a snip stack (up to 4).",
        "skill": "Snips in front of her <#ffb900ff>1 + stacks<> times for <#a974ffff>12<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>8%<> each, then a final snip for <#a974ffff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>40%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>; enemies in the centre take <#f5f5f5ff>25 true damage<> more. Every snip applies the passive. Cast within 2s of Skip 'n Slash landing, the centre is on the target.",
        "skill2": "<#ff9028ff>Skip 'n Slash<>: dashes at an enemy champion, snipping it as she lands; for 4s her attacks gain 25% attack speed, range and <#a974ffff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>20%<> on hit. Where she lands <#ff9028ff>Hallowed Mist<> settles for 4s: inside it she is <#ffb900ff>invisible<> (enemies far away cannot target her) with +22 armour and magic resist.",
        "ult": "Hurls three volleys of needles at an enemy champion - 1, 3 and 5 needles - each dealing <#a974ffff>50/60/75<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>25%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, <#ef5350ff>slowing 40%<> for 1.5s and applying the passive. She can attack between the volleys."
      },
      "league_khazix": {
        "name": "Kha'Zix",
        "attack": "Claw strikes. Passive <#ff9028ff>Unseen Threat<>: after stealth or 4s without acting, his next attack on a champion deals <#a974ffff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>25%<> <#a974ffff>bonus damage<> and slows 25%. Evolves Q, E, R at <#ffb900ff>levels 5/8/11<>.",
        "skill": "Slashes for <#ff9028ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>70%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>, or <#ff9028ff>45<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>125%<> to a target with no allies nearby (<#ffb900ff>Isolated<>). <#ff9028ff>Reaper Claws<>: longer attack range; refunds cooldown on Isolated targets.",
        "skill2": "Leaps at an enemy champion, dealing <#ff9028ff>25<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>35%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> on landing, then fires a <#ff9028ff>Void Spike<>: <#ff9028ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>50%<>, a 40% slow, and heals him <#66bb6aff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#66bb6aff>15%<> if he is in the blast. <#ff9028ff>Wings<>: longer leap, reset on champion kills.",
        "ult": "Becomes <#ffb900ff>invisible for 1.25s<> with 40% move speed and <#ff9028ff>Unseen Threat<> ready; can be cast once more. <#ff9028ff>Adaptive Cloaking<>: <#ffb900ff>2s<>, three casts."
      },
      "league_brand": {
        "name": "Brand",
        "attack": "Passive <#ff9028ff>Blaze<>: his spells set enemies ablaze for 4s, dealing <#a974ffff>6<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>4%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> a second. Spell hits on champions stack; at 3 stacks that champion detonates 2s later for <#a974ffff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>30%<> + <#f5f5f5ff>4% max health<> damage round it.",
        "skill": "After a short delay a pillar of flame rises at the target, dealing <#a974ffff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>55%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> to enemies in it and setting them ablaze; 25% more while a champion burns.",
        "skill2": "<#ff9028ff>Conflagration<>: sets an enemy champion ablaze, spreading to those around it, for <#a974ffff>45<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>35%<>. Then <#ff9028ff>Sear<>: a fireball hits the first enemy for <#a974ffff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>45%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, <#ef5350ff>stunning 0.83s<>. On a champion with Pillar of Flame ready, the pillar follows on him.",
        "ult": "A fireball bounces <#ffb900ff>5 times<> among enemies, champions first, each dealing <#a974ffff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>20%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, setting ablaze and <#ef5350ff>slowing 35%<>. Not cast on a target with no other enemy near."
      },
      "league_twitch": {
        "name": "Twitch",
        "attack": "Crossbow bolts. Passive <#ff9028ff>Deadly Venom<>: his attacks, the cask and R's bolts each add a stack of venom that deals <#ffffffff>1<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ffffffff>2%<> <#ffffffff>true damage<> per second for <#ffb900ff>6s<>.",
        "skill": "Camouflaged for up to <#ffb900ff>5s<> with 20% move speed; attacking or casting reveals him and grants 35% attack speed for <#ffb900ff>6s<>. Champion takedowns reset the cooldown.",
        "skill2": "Hurls a cask: enemies in the area gain a stack and are slowed 30%; the puddle lasts <#ffb900ff>3s<>. Then <#ff9028ff>Contaminate<>: every venom stack deals <#ff9028ff>6<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>16%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>.",
        "ult": "For <#ffb900ff>6s<>: +300 range and +15 attack; bolts pierce in a line, 10% less per unit hit (down to 60%). Cast with two enemy champions nearby."
      },
      "league_renekton": {
        "name": "Renekton",
        "attack": "Melee slashes. Passive <#ff9028ff>Reign of Anger<>: hits build Fury (up to 5 stacks, lost after <#ffb900ff>8s<> without a gain); at full Fury his next skill is empowered and spends it.",
        "skill": "Swings round him for <#ff9028ff>45<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>80%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>, healing for every enemy hit, more for champions. Empowered: <#ff9028ff>100<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>140%<>, heals x3 (only while W is on cooldown).",
        "skill2": "Dashes through an enemy champion for <#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>70%<>, then <#ff9028ff>Ruthless Predator<>: two strikes and a <#ef5350ff>stun<> of <#ffb900ff>0.75s<> (empowered: three, <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>); Q if ready, then a second dash that, empowered, shreds 25% armour.",
        "ult": "Transforms when the fight starts, for <#ffb900ff>10s<>: +300 <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0>health, every <#ffb900ff>0.5s<> 15 + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0>1% <#a974ffff>magic damage<> round him, and Fury keeps building."
      },
      "league_seraphine": {
        "name": "Seraphine",
        "attack": "Passive <#ff9028ff>Stage Presence<>: every third spell <#ff9028ff>echoes<> (cast again). Each spell gives her a note, plus one for every allied champion near her (up to <#ffb900ff>4<>); her next attack deals <#a974ffff>8<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>8%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> per note, from a longer range.",
        "skill": "Drops a high note on the target: <#a974ffff>55<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>40%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> to enemies in the area, 50% more to crowd-controlled champions.",
        "skill2": "A sound wave deals <#a974ffff>45<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>35%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> in a line and <#ef5350ff>slows 30%<>; an echoed wave <#ef5350ff>roots<> slowed champions and <#ef5350ff>stuns<> crowd-controlled ones. Then <#ff9028ff>Surround Sound<>: allied champions near her gain a <#e8d44dff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#e8d44dff>25%<> <#e8d44dff>shield<> and <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>20% Move Speed<>; after <#ffb900ff>2.5s<> each heals <#6aff55ff>8<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#6aff55ff>6%<> per allied champion near.",
        "ult": "A sound wave that travels farther past an ally deals <#a974ffff>120<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> to enemy champions and <#ef5350ff>charms<> them for <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>. Cast with two enemy champions near."
      },
      "league_lillia": {
        "name": "Lillia",
        "attack": "Passive <#ff9028ff>Dream-Laden Bough<>: her ability hits leave <#ff9028ff>Dream Dust<>: <#ffb900ff>5<> pulses of <#a974ffff>4<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>3%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> over <#ffb900ff>3s<>, plus 5% of a champion's max health as true damage, and she heals <#6aff55ff>12<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#6aff55ff>8%<>. Each cast stacks <#ff9028ff>Prance<>: <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>+5% Move Speed<> (up to <#ffb900ff>4<>).",
        "skill": "Swings her bough: <#a974ffff>35<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>30%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and Dream Dust to nearby enemies; those on the edge take the same again as true damage.",
        "skill2": "Lobs a seed: <#a974ffff>45<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>40%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and a <#ef5350ff>40% slow<>. Then <#ff9028ff>Watch Out! Eep!<>: a wound-up strike where the target stood, <#a974ffff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>30%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, <#ffb900ff>3x<> in the center.",
        "ult": "Every enemy champion with Dream Dust turns <#ef5350ff>Drowsy<> (<#ef5350ff>40% slow<>) for <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>, then falls <#ef5350ff>Asleep<> for <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>; her abilities wake sleepers for <#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>40%<> more <#a974ffff>magic damage<>."
      },
      "league_viktor": {
        "name": "Viktor",
        "attack": "Passive <#ff9028ff>Glorious Evolution<>: at level <#ffb900ff>3<> Hextech Ray leaves an aftershock, at <#ffb900ff>5<> Siphon Power's shield grows and gives <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>30% Move Speed<>, at <#ffb900ff>7<> his spells <#ef5350ff>slow 20%<>, at <#ffb900ff>9<> the storm grows and lasts longer when it moves on.",
        "skill": "A bolt deals <#a974ffff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>45%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and gives him a <#e8d44dff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#e8d44dff>20%<> <#e8d44dff>shield<>; his next attack within <#ffb900ff>4s<> deals <#a974ffff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>45%<> bonus <#a974ffff>magic damage<>.",
        "skill2": "First a <#ff9028ff>Gravity Field<> under an enemy champion <#ef5350ff>slows 35%<> and <#ef5350ff>stuns<> enemies still inside after <#ffb900ff>1.25s<> for <#ffb900ff>1.25s<>. Then a Hextech Ray from the target on away from him deals <#a974ffff>45<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>40%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>.",
        "ult": "A storm lands on an enemy champion for <#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>40%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, then deals <#a974ffff>25<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>15%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> a second round him for <#ffb900ff>6s<>, moving on to a champion near when he dies."
      },
      "league_xayah": {
        "name": "Xayah",
        "attack": "Flings blades. Passive <#ff9028ff>Clean Cuts<>: after each spell her next <#ffb900ff>3<> attacks (up to 5 stored) pierce in a line, 50% to other targets, and leave a <#ff9028ff>Feather<> behind the target for 6s.",
        "skill": "Throws two piercing daggers, each <#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>80%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> (50% after the first target), each leaving a Feather; then <#ff9028ff>Bladecaller<> calls every Feather back, each dealing <#ff9028ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60%<> to enemies it passes. From the third champion hit of one recall, <#ef5350ff>roots<> for <#ffb900ff>1.25s<>.",
        "skill2": "Gains <#ffb900ff>50%<> attack speed for 4s; each attack throws a second blade for 25% damage, and a champion hit gives 30% move speed. If <#ff9028ff>Rakan<> is nearby, he gains these too.",
        "ult": "Leaps up, taking no damage or crowd control for <#ffb900ff>1.1s<>, then rains daggers ahead for <#ff9028ff>160<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>, leaving a row of Feathers she calls back at once."
      },
      "league_lulu": {
        "name": "Lulu",
        "attack": "Fires a bolt. Passive <#ff9028ff>Pix, Faerie Companion<>: Pix fires <#ffb900ff>3 bolts<> at the same target, each dealing <#a974ffff>12<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>8%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>.",
        "skill": "Lulu and Pix each fire a piercing bolt: enemies in the line take <#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and are <#ef5350ff>slowed by 80%<>, decaying over <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>.",
        "skill2": "<#ff9028ff>Whimsy<>: <#ef5350ff>polymorphs<> an enemy champion for <#ffb900ff>1.75s<> (no attacks or spells, slowed) and deals <#a974ffff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>40%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>; <#ff9028ff>Help, Pix!<>: a nearby allied champion gets a <#9fd8ffff>110<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#9fd8ffff>50%<> <#9fd8ffff>shield<> and <#ffb900ff>25%<> move and attack speed for <#ffb900ff>3.5s<>.",
        "ult": "In a fight, an allied champion in crowd control or with enemies on him (or Lulu) grows: <#7cfc00ff>+350 health<>, nearby enemies are <#ef5350ff>knocked up for 1s<> and <#ef5350ff>slowed by 30%<> around him for <#ffb900ff>7s<>."
      },
      "league_vladimir": {
        "name": "Vladimir",
        "attack": "Fires blood bolts. Passive <#ff9028ff>Crimson Pact<>: his skills also scale with his max health. <#ff9028ff>Sanguine Pool<> (automatic): in danger he becomes a pool for <#ffb900ff>2s<>, untargetable; enemies on it take <#a974ffff>25<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>10%<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#a974ffff>2%<> per pulse and are <#ef5350ff>slowed 40%<>, he heals <#7cfc00ff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#7cfc00ff>8%<>. Costs 5% max health.",
        "skill": "Drains the target for <#a974ffff>100<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>75%<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#a974ffff>5%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>; the blood heals him <#7cfc00ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#7cfc00ff>30%<> when it returns. Every 2nd cast is <#ff9028ff>Crimson Rush<>: 180% damage, double heal, +30% move speed. <#ff9028ff>Combo E-Q<>: a Q within <#ffb900ff>2.5s<> of Tides hitting a champion is Crimson Rush at once.",
        "skill2": "Charges for <#ffb900ff>0.97s<>, then fires a bolt at every enemy around for <#a974ffff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70%<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#a974ffff>5%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and a <#ef5350ff>40% slow<>. <#ff9028ff>Combo E-W<>: if E is ready when Sanguine Pool ends, he rises with a 70% Tides of Blood.",
        "ult": "Infects enemy champions' area: enemies take 10% more damage for <#ffb900ff>3s<>, then burst for <#a974ffff>200<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80%<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#a974ffff>6%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>; each champion hit heals him <#7cfc00ff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#7cfc00ff>30%<>. <#ff9028ff>Combo Flash-R-E<>: with E ready he first blinks into them as a blood mist, then casts a 70% Tides of Blood."
      },
      "league_rengar": {
        "name": "Rengar",
        "attack": "Blade swings. <#ff9028ff>Unseen Predator<>: on respawn, after <#ffb900ff>3s<> out of combat or after R, his next attack leaps at a distant target for <#ff9028ff>20<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>150%<>. Skills and leaps give 1 <#ff9028ff>Ferocity<>; at 4 his next skill is empowered. <#ff9028ff>Savagery<> (automatic, <#ffb900ff>5s<>): an attack for <#ff9028ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>90%<> and +40% attack speed; empowered <#ff9028ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>140%<>. <#ff9028ff>Combos<>: air Q, triple Q.",
        "skill": "Roars, dealing <#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>50%<> to enemies around him and healing <#66bb6aff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#66bb6aff>50%<>. <#ff9028ff>Empowered<>: 200% heal and <#ef5350ff>immune to crowd control<> for <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>.",
        "skill2": "Throws a bola: the first enemy hit takes <#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60%<> and is <#ef5350ff>slowed 40%<> for <#ffb900ff>1.75s<>. <#ff9028ff>Empowered<>: <#ef5350ff>rooted 1.75s<>. <#ff9028ff>Combo leap-E<>: within <#ffb900ff>1.5s<> of a leap onto a champion the bola cannot miss and <#ef5350ff>roots 1s<>.",
        "ult": "On a champion in a fight: camouflaged for <#ffb900ff>5s<>, +40% move speed; his next attack is a leap for <#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>80%<> more and <#ef5350ff>-25% armour<> for <#ffb900ff>4s<>. <#ff9028ff>Combo R one-shot<>: R, leap, rooting E, Savagery."
      },
      "league_kogmaw": {
        "name": "Kog'Maw",
        "attack": "Spits acid. <#ff9028ff>Bio-Arcane Barrage<> (automatic, <#ffb900ff>12s<>): an attack turns it on for <#ffb900ff>8s<>: +180 range and attacks deal <#ff9028ff>5% of the target's max health<>. <#ff9028ff>Icathian Surprise<>: when he dies his void form chases a nearby enemy champion and bursts for <#f5f5f5ff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#f5f5f5ff>100%<> true damage.",
        "skill": "Spits caustic acid: the first enemy hit takes <#ff9028ff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>70%<> and loses <#ef5350ff>20% armour and magic resist<> for <#ffb900ff>4s<>. Passive: +35% attack speed. <#ff9028ff>Combo<>: when Bio-Arcane Barrage turns on, a Caustic Spittle follows.",
        "skill2": "Spews piercing void ooze for <#ff9028ff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60%<>, <#ef5350ff>slowing 35%<>, and leaves a slowing trail for <#ffb900ff>4s<>. <#ff9028ff>Combo<>: an ooze that hits a champion calls a Living Artillery shell on it.",
        "ult": "Shells a fighting champion far away: after <#ffb900ff>0.67s<> it lands for <#ff9028ff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>65%<>; champions left under <#f5f5f5ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#f5f5f5ff>35%<> health die. Up to <#ffb900ff>3 shells<> a volley, then <#ffb900ff>20s<> cooldown."
      },
      "league_zed": {
        "name": "Zed",
        "attack": "Wrist blades. <#ff9028ff>Contempt for the Weak<>: after his spells hit a champion, his next attack on a champion adds 6% of its max health as true damage (<#ffb900ff>10s<>). <#ff9028ff>Shadow Slash<> (automatic, <#ffb900ff>4s<>): a spin for <#ff9028ff>65<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>75%<> around him, <#ef5350ff>slowing champions 25%<>.",
        "skill": "Sends his shadow onto an enemy champion (<#ffb900ff>5s<>), then Shadow Slash and Razor Shuriken if ready; while it stands it copies every shuriken and slash of his. With one enemy near the shadow, he trades places with it to chase.",
        "skill2": "Throws a shuriken through a line: <#ff9028ff>75<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<> to the first enemy, 60% to the rest.",
        "ult": "On a champion in a fight: <#ef5350ff>untargetable<>, he dashes through him, leaving a shadow (it copies his shuriken and slash) and a mark that bursts after <#ffb900ff>3s<> for <#ff9028ff>110<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<> plus <#ff9028ff>35<> per hit meanwhile (up to 3). On a kill, outnumbered or crowd-controlled, he trades places with the shadow."
      },
      "league_olaf": {
        "name": "Olaf",
        "attack": "Axe swing. <#ff9028ff>Berserker Rage<>: the more he is hit, the faster he attacks (+20% a level, 4 levels; the top two also 12% life steal). <#ff9028ff>Tough It Out<> (automatic, <#ffb900ff>13s<>): in a fight +40% attack speed and a shield. <#ff9028ff>Ragnarok<> passive: +12 armour and magic resistance.",
        "skill": "Throws an axe at the target's spot: <#ff9028ff>100<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<> to every enemy on the way, <#ef5350ff>slowed 30%<>, armour -20%. The axe stays <#ffb900ff>5s<>; walking over it picks it up and cuts the cooldown short.",
        "skill2": "A reckless blow for <#f5f5f5ff>110<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#f5f5f5ff>90%<><#f5f5f5ff> true damage<>; he takes 30% of it himself, refunded on a kill.",
        "ult": "<#ef5350ff>Immune to crowd control<>, +30% attack and +20% move speed for <#ffb900ff>3s<>; hitting champions keeps it going (up to <#ffb900ff>10s<>)."
      },
      "league_karma": {
        "name": "Karma",
        "attack": "Fires a spirit bolt. <#ff9028ff>Gathering Fire<>: spell hits on champions cut Mantra's cooldown by up to <#ffb900ff>60%<>. <#ff9028ff>Inspire<> (automatic, <#ffb900ff>9s<>): an ally in crowd control or in a fight (or Karma) gets a <#9fd8ffff>110<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#9fd8ffff>50%<> <#9fd8ffff>shield<> and <#ffb900ff>+35%<> move speed.",
        "skill": "Fires a spirit flame that bursts on the first enemy hit: enemies around take <#a974ffff>100<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and are <#ef5350ff>slowed by 35%<>. <#ff9028ff>Soulflare<> (Mantra): <#a974ffff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>30%<> more and a circle of flame that blows <#ffb900ff>1.5s<> later for <#a974ffff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50%<>, <#ef5350ff>slowing 50%<>.",
        "skill2": "Tethers an enemy champion for <#a974ffff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>40%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>; unbroken for <#ffb900ff>1.33s<> it deals the damage again and <#ef5350ff>roots for 1.67s<>. <#ff9028ff>Renewal<> (Mantra, when crowded): heals <#7cfc00ff>110<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#7cfc00ff>40%<> and <#ef5350ff>roots for 2.33s<>. <#ff9028ff>Combo<>: a root is followed by a Soulflare.",
        "ult": "Empowers her next spell within <#ffb900ff>6s<>: with an ally in danger, <#ff9028ff>Defiance<> at once (allies around him get a <#9fd8ffff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#9fd8ffff>30%<> <#9fd8ffff>shield<> and the haste); else the next Q, or W when crowded. Unused, the cooldown comes back."
      },
      "league_hecarim": {
        "name": "Hecarim",
        "attack": "Glaive strikes. <#ff9028ff>Warpath<>: more attack while he charges. <#ff9028ff>Spirit of Dread<> (automatic, <#ffb900ff>14s<>): starts on his Q, E or R with an enemy champion near: <#ffb900ff>4s<> of +20 armour and magic resist, <#a974ffff>14 magic damage<> to enemies around him every second, healing <#66bb6aff>12<> for each one hit.",
        "skill": "Spins the glaive: enemies around take <#ff9028ff>45<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>85%<> damage. A hit gives a <#ff9028ff>Rampage<> stack (up to 2, <#ffb900ff>8s<>), each +20% damage - stacks built on camps carry into a gank.",
        "skill2": "Charges the target, harder the longer he rides (up to 200%): <#ff9028ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60%<> damage and a <#ef5350ff>knockback<>, then +25% move speed.",
        "ult": "Rides at an enemy champion with spectral riders: enemies in the path take <#ff9028ff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<> damage; on landing enemies around are <#ef5350ff>feared 0.75s<> (<#ef5350ff>1.33s<> after a long ride), and he spins a <#ff9028ff>Rampage<> and starts <#ff9028ff>Spirit of Dread<>."
      },
      "league_talon": {
        "name": "Talon",
        "attack": "Wrist-blade strikes. <#ff9028ff>Blade's End<>: his spells wound champions they hit; at 3 wounds his next attack makes it <#ff9028ff>bleed<> for <#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>120%<> over <#ffb900ff>2s<>. <#ff9028ff>Assassin's Path<> (automatic, <#ffb900ff>10s<>): when his blades return or his Q kills with 2 enemy champions near, he vaults away and runs faster.",
        "skill": "Throws a fan of blades for <#ff9028ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>40%<> damage; they fly back for <#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>70%<> damage and a <#ef5350ff>40% slow<>.",
        "skill2": "Leaps at the target for <#ff9028ff>48<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<> damage; next to it he stabs instead, a 150% critical strike. A kill heals <#66bb6aff>60<> and refunds the cooldown.",
        "ult": "Sends a ring of blades out for <#ff9028ff>55<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>75%<> damage, then turns <#ff9028ff>invisible<> for <#ffb900ff>2.5s<> with +40% move speed; the blades return when it ends or he attacks, dealing the same again."
      },
      "league_draven": {
        "name": "Draven",
        "attack": "Throws axes. <#ff9028ff>League of Draven<>: each caught axe gives 1 Adoration (up to 6, +4 attack each); an axe kill on a champion cashes them in: 25 health each and +30% attack speed for <#ffb900ff>4s<>. <#ff9028ff>Blood Rush<> (automatic, <#ffb900ff>12s<>): attacking a champion gives +40% move speed and +35% attack speed; a catch resets it.",
        "skill": "Spins an axe in his hand (up to 2): his next attack deals <#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>55%<> bonus damage. The axe bounces up and lands at a random spot near him after <#ffb900ff>0.4s<>; he runs into the circle to catch it, still spinning.",
        "skill2": "Throws a pair of piercing axes for <#ff9028ff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>50%<>, <#ef5350ff>knocking enemies back<> and <#ef5350ff>slowing 30%<> for <#ffb900ff>2s<>.",
        "ult": "Hurls two huge, wide axes at a fighting champion far away; they fly a long way, dealing <#ff9028ff>110<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>80%<> to every enemy passed, turn at the first champion (or the end) and fly back, dealing it again."
      },
      "league_senna": {
        "name": "Senna",
        "attack": "<#ff9028ff>Absolution<>: her hits mark an enemy champion; the next attack takes it: +3% max health damage, 1 Mist. +1 Mist per attack every <#ffb900ff>6s<> and per champion kill. Mist: +1 attack, some range, +1% crit per 2 (lost on death). <#ff9028ff>Curse of the Black Mist<> (auto): an enemy champion near, she and nearby allies are invisible <#ffb900ff>4s<>, +20% speed.",
        "skill": "The relic cannon fires a shadow beam through its target: enemies in the line take <#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>50%<> physical damage and are <#ef5350ff>slowed 20%<> for <#ffb900ff>1.25s<>; allied champions in it heal <#7cfc00ff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#7cfc00ff>35%<>.",
        "skill2": "Fires the Black Mist: it clings to the first enemy hit, dealing <#ff9028ff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60%<> physical damage, and after <#ffb900ff>1s<> spreads, <#ef5350ff>rooting<> it and the enemies around it for <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>.",
        "ult": "Charges, then fires a beam of light across the battlefield at a fighting champion far away: its core deals <#ff9028ff>150<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>75%<> physical damage to enemy champions; its wide light gives her and the allied champions along it a <#9fd8ffff>120<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#9fd8ffff>40% shield<> for <#ffb900ff>3s<>."
      },
      "league_shen": {
        "name": "Shen",
        "attack": "Sword strike. <#ff9028ff>Ki Barrier<>: every ability gives him a <#ffb900ff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ffb900ff>40%<> shield for <#ffb900ff>2s<> (once every <#ffb900ff>8s<>, sooner when abilities hit champions). Empowered attacks deal 25 more, and to champions 4% of their max health (6% and +50% attack speed if the blade passed one).",
        "skill": "Recalls his spirit blade from behind the target: <#ff9028ff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>80%<> and <#ef5350ff>25% slow<> to enemies on its way; his next 3 attacks are empowered. With an enemy champion near on its return, <#ff9028ff>Spirit's Refuge<>: for <#ffb900ff>1.75s<> allied champions in the zone take no basic attack damage (<#ffb900ff>15s<> cooldown).",
        "skill2": "Dashes forward: <#ff9028ff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>80%<> to enemies passed, <#ef5350ff>taunted 1.17s<>. Taunting a champion with Twilight Assault ready also pulls the blade from where the dash began, through them.",
        "ult": "When an allied champion anywhere is crowd-controlled, or locked in a fight far from Shen: a <#ffb900ff>260<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ffb900ff>60%<> shield on it for <#ffb900ff>5s<>; Shen channels <#ffb900ff>2.5s<> and teleports to it (crowd control breaks it)."
      },
      "league_syndra": {
        "name": "Syndra",
        "attack": "Passive <#ff9028ff>Transcendent<>: at level <#ffb900ff>3<> Dark Sphere deals 25% more to champions, at <#ffb900ff>5<> Force of Will adds <#ffffffff>20% true damage<>, at <#ffb900ff>7<> Scatter the Weak grows, at <#ffb900ff>9<> Unleashed Power ignores Magic Resist.",
        "skill": "A Dark Sphere deals <#a974ffff>62<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>52%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> around it and stays for <#ffb900ff>6s<>.",
        "skill2": "First <#ff9028ff>Force of Will<> throws a sphere at an enemy champion for <#a974ffff>55<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>55%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, <#ef5350ff>slowing 30%<>. Then a cone deals <#a974ffff>45<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>45%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and knocks enemies back; spheres pushed <#ef5350ff>stun<> enemies near them for <#ffb900ff>1.25s<>.",
        "ult": "Fires <#ffb900ff>3 + her spheres<> (up to 7) at an enemy champion, each dealing <#a974ffff>52<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>18%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>."
      },
      "league_viego": {
        "name": "Viego",
        "attack": "<#ff9028ff>Sovereign's Domination<>: an enemy champion he damaged dies within 3s - he possesses its soul for <#ffb900ff>10s<>: <#ef5350ff>untouchable 1s<>, heals <#ffb900ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ffb900ff>50%<>, +20% attack, +30% attack speed, +15% move speed, Q and W cooldowns halved. Attacks deal 2% of a champion's max health.",
        "skill": "Thrusts forward: <#ff9028ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>70%<>. A champion hit is marked for <#ffb900ff>4s<>: his next attack on it strikes twice, <#ff9028ff>20<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60%<> more, and heals <#ffb900ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ffb900ff>30%<>.",
        "skill2": "<#ff9028ff>Harrowed Path<>: mist rises - <#ffb900ff>5s<> of +30% move speed and +40% attack speed, hidden while in the mist (2.5s). Then he dashes and looses a wraith: the first enemy hit takes <#ff9028ff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>70%<> and is <#ef5350ff>stunned 1.1s<>.",
        "ult": "Leaps at an enemy champion his team is fighting, <#ef5350ff>slowing it 99%<>, and pierces it on landing: <#ff9028ff>120<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>120%<> + 12% of its max health; other enemies near are knocked back. Ends a possession."
      },
      "league_zeri": {
        "name": "Zeri",
        "attack": "Attacks are <#ff9028ff>Burst Fire<>: seven rounds at the first enemy hit. Passive <#ff9028ff>Living Battery<>: every <#ffb900ff>5<> attacks charge her pack; the next is a charged shot dealing <#a974ffff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>100%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> more and <#ef5350ff>slowing<>; on a champion also <#ffffffff>4% max health true damage<>, and she gains a shield and Move Speed.",
        "skill": "Fires an electric pulse dealing <#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>110%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> to the first enemy hit, <#ef5350ff>slowing 35%<>. If a minion or monster stops it, it bursts into a long laser that hits and slows every enemy behind.",
        "skill2": "Dashes a short way (back when an enemy is close), then for <#ffb900ff>5s<> Burst Fire pierces: enemies after the first take 80% damage and <#a974ffff>20<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>30%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>. Champion hits lower the cooldowns.",
        "ult": "A nova deals <#a974ffff>150<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>100%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> around her and overcharges her for <#ffb900ff>5s<>: +30% Attack Speed, +20% Move Speed that stacks and lasts longer with champion hits; Burst Fire becomes a triple shot that chains lightning between enemies."
      },
      "league_nautilus": {
        "name": "Nautilus",
        "attack": "<#ff9028ff>Staggering Blow<>: his attack on an enemy champion <#ef5350ff>roots it 0.83s<> and deals <#a974ffff>20<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>30%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> more, then rests <#ffb900ff>6s<>.",
        "skill": "Throws his anchor at the first enemy champion: <#a974ffff>75<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, and the two are pulled toward each other.",
        "skill2": "<#ff9028ff>Titan's Wrath<>: a <#9fd8ffff>110<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#9fd8ffff>60%<> <#9fd8ffff>shield<>; for <#ffb900ff>6s<> his attacks also hit enemies round the target for <#a974ffff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>20%<>. <#ff9028ff>Riptide<>: three waves round him deal <#a974ffff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and <#ef5350ff>slow 40%<> for <#ffb900ff>1.25s<>.",
        "ult": "Sends a shockwave at an enemy champion in range: enemies on its way are <#ef5350ff>knocked up<> for <#a974ffff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>30%<>; the champion takes <#a974ffff>150<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, <#ef5350ff>airborne 1s, then stunned 0.75s<>."
      },
      "league_gragas": {
        "name": "Gragas",
        "attack": "<#ff9028ff>Happy Hour<>: every skill starts with a swig that heals <#7dd87dff>55/85 + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0>20%<> (the second from level 3), then rests <#ffb900ff>12s<>.",
        "skill": "Rolls a barrel that bursts <#ffb900ff>0.75s<> after it lands: <#a974ffff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> round it and a <#ef5350ff>40% slow<> for <#ffb900ff>2s<>.",
        "skill2": "Charges and stops on the first enemy in his way: <#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> round him and a <#ef5350ff>1s stun<>; a hit returns part of the cooldown. <#ff9028ff>Drunken Rage<>: then he drinks - 20% less damage for <#ffb900ff>2.5s<>, and his next attack deals <#a974ffff>55<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> round him, champions also 6% max health as true damage.",
        "ult": "Hurls his cask at an enemy champion: <#a974ffff>240<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> round it, and the enemies are <#ef5350ff>blown toward him<>."
      },
      "league_irelia": {
        "name": "Irelia",
        "attack": "Passive <#ff9028ff>Ionian Fervor<>: Bladesurge hits and spell hits on champions grant a stack of +11% Attack Speed (max <#ffb900ff>4<>, <#ffb900ff>6s<>). At full stacks her attacks deal <#ff9028ff>12<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>20%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> more.",
        "skill": "Dashes to the target, dealing <#ff9028ff>38<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>80%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> and healing 10 + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0>13%. If the target was <#ff9028ff>Marked<> or dies, she dashes again at once, up to <#ffb900ff>3<> dashes a cast.",
        "skill2": "Two blades converge: enemies between take <#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>80%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> and are <#ef5350ff>stunned 0.75s<>; champions are <#ff9028ff>Marked<>. On cooldown, up close she uses <#ff9028ff>Defiant Dance<>: a guard taking 50% less attack damage, then a strike for <#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>115%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>.",
        "ult": "Fires blades that burst on the first champion: enemies in the cone take <#ff9028ff>120<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>85%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>, are <#ef5350ff>slowed 70% and disarmed 1s<>, champions <#ff9028ff>Marked<>. A blade wall stays <#ffb900ff>2.5s<>, slowing enemies inside 40%."
      },
      "league_kassadin": {
        "name": "Kassadin",
        "attack": "<#ff9028ff>Void Stone<>: takes about 10% less magic damage. <#ff9028ff>Nether Blade<>: attacks deal <#a974ffff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>10%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>; every <#ffb900ff>7s<> one attack deals <#a974ffff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> more.",
        "skill": "Fires an orb at the target: <#a974ffff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, interrupting a champion. He gains a 50 + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0>40% shield for <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>.",
        "skill2": "Releases a pulse in a cone ahead: <#a974ffff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and a <#ef5350ff>50% slow<> for <#ffb900ff>1s<>. Each Null Sphere or Riftwalk he casts shortens its cooldown.",
        "ult": "Blinks next to a nearby enemy champion: <#a974ffff>100<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> round him. Cast again within <#ffb900ff>15s<> for a stack (at most <#ffb900ff>3<>), each adding <#a974ffff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>10%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>."
      },
      "league_corki": {
        "name": "Corki",
        "attack": "<#ff9028ff>Hextech Munitions<>: 20% of his attacks' damage is <#ffffffff>true damage<>. <#ff9028ff>Special Delivery<>: at the start, after a respawn and every <#ffb900ff>45s<> his next Valkyrie is the Package: the take-off <#ef5350ff>knocks back<> champions near him for <#a974ffff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>30%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, he flies farther, the fire is wider and lasts longer, and he gains 30% move speed.",
        "skill": "Lobs a phosphorus bomb at a spot: enemies in the blast take <#a974ffff>95<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>55%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>.",
        "skill2": "<#ff9028ff>Gatling Gun<>: sprays a cone ahead for <#ffb900ff>4s<>, each burst <#ff9028ff>9<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>16%<> <#ff9028ff>physical<> and <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>9% magic damage<>, stacking armour and magic resistance shred. On cooldown with a champion close: <#ff9028ff>Valkyrie<>, a dash back leaving fire that deals <#a974ffff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>12%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> every <#ffb900ff>0.5s<>.",
        "ult": "Stores <#ffb900ff>4 missiles<> (one back every <#ffb900ff>10s<>); each bursts on the first enemy hit for <#a974ffff>75<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>42%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>52%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> around it. Every third is the Big One: a wider blast for 200% damage."
      },
      "league_braum": {
        "name": "Braum",
        "attack": "<#ff9028ff>Concussive Blows<>: attacks and Winter's Bite stack on champions; the <#ffb900ff>4th<> <#ef5350ff>stuns 1.25s<> and deals <#a974ffff>85<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, then for <#ffb900ff>8s<> no stacks and attacks deal <#a974ffff>12<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>10%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> more.",
        "skill": "Hurls ice from his shield: <#a974ffff>105<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<> + 2% max health <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and a <#ef5350ff>70% slow<> fading to 35% over <#ffb900ff>2s<>.",
        "skill2": "Raises his shield for <#ffb900ff>3.5s<>: 50% less damage, a 60 + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0>40% shield, allied champions beside him 20% less. <#ff9028ff>Stand Behind Me<>: leaps to an allied champion; both gain 30 armour and magic resist for <#ffb900ff>3s<>.",
        "ult": "Slams the ground: a fissure runs at the target, dealing <#a974ffff>180<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and <#ef5350ff>knocking up 0.6s<> (the first champion 1.25s); the fissure <#ef5350ff>slows 40%<> for <#ffb900ff>4s<>."
      },
      "league_mordekaiser": {
        "name": "Mordekaiser",
        "attack": "<#ff9028ff>Darkness Rise<>: his attacks deal <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>40% magic damage<> more. Attacks, Q and E hitting champions stack it; at 3 stacks he moves 3% faster and deals <#a974ffff>4<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>15%<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#a974ffff>1%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> to enemies around him every <#ffb900ff>0.5s<>.",
        "skill": "Slams his mace down a line ahead for <#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>; hitting a single enemy, <#a974ffff>112<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>98%<> instead.",
        "skill2": "Lashes out a grasp for <#a974ffff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, <#ef5350ff>pulling<> enemies to him. On cooldown with a champion close: <#ff9028ff>Indestructible<>, a <#7ee87eff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#7ee87eff>60% shield<>; if it still holds, he heals <#7ee87eff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#7ee87eff>40%<>.",
        "ult": "Curses an enemy champion for <#ffb900ff>7s<>: steals 10% of its attack, ability power, armour, magic resistance and health and <#ef5350ff>drags it back<> if it runs. Killing it meanwhile heals him <#7ee87eff>150<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#7ee87eff>50%<>."
      },
      "league_nidalee": {
        "name": "Nidalee",
        "attack": "<#ff9028ff>Prowl<>: javelin and trap hits hunt a champion for <#ffb900ff>4s<> (+20% move speed). Before each attack she switches between human (ranged) and cougar (melee) as the fight needs, every <#ffb900ff>3s<> at most.",
        "skill": "Human: throws a javelin for <#a974ffff>88<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, more the farther it flies (up to 220%). <#ff9028ff>Takedown<>: her next attack deals <#ff8a65ff>40<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff8a65ff>50%<> <#ff8a65ff>physical<> and <#a974ffff>52<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>62%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> more, +40% on the hunted.",
        "skill2": "Human: heals an allied champion for <#7dd87dff>45<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#7dd87dff>45%<> and gives 40% attack speed for <#ffb900ff>7s<>; on cooldown she sets a <#ff9028ff>Bushwhack<> trap, <#a974ffff>18<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>16%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> a pulse. <#ff9028ff>Pounce<>: leaps for <#a974ffff>70<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>48%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>; <#ff9028ff>Swipe<>: <#a974ffff>98<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> around her.",
        "ult": "Turns into the cougar, resets the cougar's abilities and pounces on a champion for <#a974ffff>160<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>90%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, then swipes and readies Takedown."
      },
      "league_galio": {
        "name": "Galio",
        "attack": "<#ff9028ff>Colossal Smash<>: every <#ffb900ff>4s<> his next attack deals <#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> to enemies around him. <#ff9028ff>Shield of Durand<> passive: attacking grants a <#7dd87dff>90 + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0>30%<> shield, once every <#ffb900ff>12s<>.",
        "skill": "Fires two windblasts: <#a974ffff>120<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> where they land, leaving a tornado for <#ffb900ff>2s<> that deals <#a974ffff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>18%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> every <#ffb900ff>0.5s<>.",
        "skill2": "Charges at an enemy champion: the first champion hit takes <#a974ffff>130<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>90%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and is <#ef5350ff>knocked up 0.75s<>. <#ff9028ff>Shield of Durand<>: braces for <#ffb900ff>0.83s<> taking 40% less damage, then <#ef5350ff>taunts<> nearby enemies for <#ef5350ff>1.17s<>, dealing <#a974ffff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>.",
        "ult": "Grants an allied champion in a fight a <#7dd87dff>150 + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0>50%<> shield, channels <#ffb900ff>2s<> and flies to it; landing deals <#a974ffff>220<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>90%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and <#ef5350ff>knocks up 0.75s<>; allied champions there are shielded too."
      },
      "league_nilah": {
        "name": "Nilah",
        "attack": "<#ff9028ff>Joy Unending<>: melee whip-blade attacks. For <#ffb900ff>4s<> after <#ff9028ff>Formless Blade<> they reach 125 farther, cut a cone for <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff8a65ff>25%<> more <#ff8a65ff>physical damage<> and heal her for 10% of the damage.",
        "skill": "Lashes her whip-blade in a line, dealing <#ff8a65ff>40<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff8a65ff>100%<> <#ff8a65ff>physical damage<> to every enemy on it, and empowers her attacks for <#ffb900ff>4s<>.",
        "skill2": "<#ff9028ff>Slipstream<>: dashes through an enemy champion, dealing <#ff8a65ff>60<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff8a65ff>45%<> <#ff8a65ff>physical damage<> around her landing; <#ffb900ff>2 charges<>. With both spent, <#ff9028ff>Jubilant Veil<>: for <#ffb900ff>2.25s<> she dodges every attack, takes 25% less from abilities and gains 20% move speed; nearby allied champions get the same for <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>.",
        "ult": "Spins her whip-blade for <#ffb900ff>1s<>, dealing <#ff8a65ff>12<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff8a65ff>20%<> <#ff8a65ff>physical damage<> a hit, then <#ff8a65ff>100<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff8a65ff>110%<> <#ff8a65ff>physical damage<> and pulls nearby enemies to her; nearby allied champions heal <#7dd87dff>40<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#7dd87dff>30%<> and gain a <#7dd87dff>40<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#7dd87dff>30%<> shield."
      },
      "league_bard": {
        "name": "Bard",
        "attack": "Fires a star bolt. Passive <#ff9028ff>Traveler's Call<>: every <#ffb900ff>3s<> a Meep flies with his attack, dealing <#a974ffff>45<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> to enemies around the target and <#ef5350ff>slowing them by 25%<> for <#ffb900ff>1s<>.",
        "skill": "Fires a bolt of cosmic energy: the first enemy hit takes <#a974ffff>100<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>75%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and is <#ef5350ff>slowed by 60%<>; if another enemy is behind it, both take the damage and are <#ef5350ff>stunned for 1.5s<>.",
        "skill2": "<#ff9028ff>Caretaker's Shrine<>: throws a shrine to an allied champion in a fight (or himself), healing <#7cfc00ff>140<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#7cfc00ff>60%<> and giving 30% move speed. <#ff9028ff>Magical Journey<>: when enemies close in, opens a door and takes nearby allied champions away with him, +40% move speed (every <#ffb900ff>16s<>).",
        "ult": "Lobs a golden orb at grouped enemy champions (or an allied champion in crowd control): every unit in the area, allies, Bard and turrets included, is put in <#ef5350ff>stasis for 2.5s<> - it cannot act, be targeted or be harmed."
      },
      "league_sion": {
        "name": "Sion",
        "attack": "<#ff9028ff>Soul Furnace<> passive: each unit his attack kills grants <#6aff55ff>6<> maximum health for good (lost on death).",
        "skill": "Charges for <#ffb900ff>0.67s<>, then smashes the line in front: <#ff9028ff>140<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>180%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> and <#ef5350ff>knocked up 0.83s<>. Crowd control on him breaks the charge.",
        "skill2": "Roars through minions: <#a974ffff>120<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#a974ffff>4%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, <#ef5350ff>slowed 40%<> and armour -20%. <#ff9028ff>Soul Furnace<>: a <#e8d44dff>220<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#e8d44dff>100%<> shield; still holding it after <#ffb900ff>3s<>, it blasts nearby enemies for <#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#a974ffff>8%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>.",
        "ult": "Charges at an enemy champion, immune to crowd control: the first champion hit takes <#ff9028ff>200-400<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> and is <#ef5350ff>knocked up 0.75-1.58s<> (the farther he ran, the more); nearby enemies are <#ef5350ff>slowed 40%<>. Saved for an ally in crowd control, a teamfight or a chase beside an ally."
      },
      "league_kindred": {
        "name": "Kindred",
        "attack": "<#ff9028ff>Mark of the Kindred<>: Lamb's arrows. Each takedown of an enemy champion she hit gives a mark (lost on death): +15 range, +4% attack speed, <#ff9028ff>Mounting Dread<> +<#a974ffff>8 magic damage<>.",
        "skill": "Leaps a short way (back when an enemy closes in) and shoots an arrow at each of up to <#ffb900ff>3<> nearby enemies for <#ff8a65ff>45<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff8a65ff>65%<> <#ff8a65ff>physical damage<>; +35% attack speed for <#ffb900ff>4s<>. Inside <#ff9028ff>Wolf's Frenzy<> the cooldown is <#ffb900ff>4s<>.",
        "skill2": "<#ff9028ff>Mounting Dread<>: marks an enemy and <#ef5350ff>slows it 30%<>; her <#ffb900ff>3rd<> attack hit after it sends Wolf at the marked one for <#ff8a65ff>60<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff8a65ff>90%<> <#ff8a65ff>physical damage<> (+4% max health on champions). On cooldown, <#ff9028ff>Wolf's Frenzy<>: for <#ffb900ff>8.5s<> a zone where Wolf bites one enemy every second for <#ff8a65ff>25<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff8a65ff>25%<> <#ff8a65ff>physical damage<>.",
        "ult": "When an allied champion near her is crowd-controlled with an enemy champion beside him, or, in a sustained fight, an allied champion (or she) has 2 or more enemy champions beside him, she blesses the ground around her: for <#ffb900ff>4s<> allied champions in it cannot die, then they heal <#7dd87dff>150<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#7dd87dff>40%<>."
      },
      "league_malzahar": {
        "name": "Malzahar",
        "attack": "Fires a void bolt. Passive <#ff9028ff>Void Shift<>: a <#ffb900ff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#ffb900ff>40%<> shield; while it holds he is <#ef5350ff>immune to crowd control<>. Broken, it returns after <#ffb900ff>12s<>.",
        "skill": "<#ff9028ff>Malefic Visions<>: deals <#a974ffff>170<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> over <#ffb900ff>4s<>; if the target dies, the vision jumps to a nearby enemy. <#ff9028ff>Void Swarm<>: voidlings bite the target, <#a974ffff>14<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>8%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> every <#ffb900ff>0.5s<>.",
        "skill2": "Opens two void rifts beside the target; as they close, enemies in the area take <#a974ffff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>45%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and are <#ef5350ff>silenced for 1.5s<>.",
        "ult": "Suppresses an enemy champion (the vision's target first): <#ef5350ff>stunned<> while he channels, it takes <#a974ffff>220<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> over <#ffb900ff>2.5s<> and leaves a damaging void zone. Crowd control on Malzahar ends the channel."
      },
      "league_smolder": {
        "name": "Smolder",
        "attack": "Spits a small fireball. Passive <#ff9028ff>Dragon Practice<>: each champion his abilities hit and each unit his breath kills gives a stack (lost on death), adding <#a974ffff>0.75/1.65/0.25 magic damage<> to the breath, the sneeze and each flight fireball. At <#ffb900ff>10/25/40<> stacks the breath gains an explosion, blowback fireballs and a burn.",
        "skill": "Breathes a fireball for <#ff8a65ff>60<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff8a65ff>120%<> <#ff8a65ff>physical damage<>. <#ffb900ff>10<> stacks: it explodes on the enemies around the target. <#ffb900ff>25<>: fireballs blow back behind the target (50% damage). <#ffb900ff>40<>: it burns for <#ffb900ff>3s<>, <#f5f5f5ff>10<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#f5f5f5ff>10%<>+<#f5f5f5ff>1% max health true damage<> a second.",
        "skill2": "Sneezes fire for <#ff8a65ff>40<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff8a65ff>40%<> <#ff8a65ff>physical damage<> and a <#ef5350ff>35% slow<>; on a champion it explodes for <#ff8a65ff>40<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff8a65ff>40%<> <#ff8a65ff>physical damage<>. When dived, or chasing a wounded enemy: <#ff9028ff>Flap, Flap, Flap<> - he flies, gains <#ffffffff>40% move speed<> and fires <#ffb900ff>5<> fireballs at the weakest enemy, <#ff8a65ff>10<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff8a65ff>30%<> <#ff8a65ff>physical damage<> each.",
        "ult": "Calls his mother, who breathes fire along a line: <#ff8a65ff>110<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff8a65ff>80%<> <#ff8a65ff>physical damage<>; enemies in the middle take <#ffb900ff>50%<> more and are <#ef5350ff>slowed 40%<> for <#ffb900ff>2s<>. If Smolder stands on the middle line he heals <#6aff55ff>80<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#6aff55ff>30%<>."
      },
      "league_milio": {
        "name": "Milio",
        "attack": "Throws a small fireball. Passive <#ff9028ff>Fired Up!<>: allies his spells touch gain <#ffb900ff>30%<> attack and ability power for <#ffb900ff>5s<>; Milio gains <#ffb900ff>15%<> move speed.",
        "skill": "Kicks a fireball that knocks back the first enemy hit, then falls on it: enemies around take <#a974ffff>120<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and are <#ef5350ff>slowed by 40%<> for <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>.",
        "skill2": "<#ff9028ff>Warm Hugs<> (2 charges): an allied champion gains a <#9fd8ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#9fd8ffff>40%<> <#9fd8ffff>shield<> and <#ffb900ff>16%<> move speed for <#ffb900ff>2.5s<>. <#ff9028ff>Cozy Campfire<>: a fire follows them for <#ffb900ff>6s<>, every <#ffb900ff>1s<> healing allies nearby <#7cfc00ff>22<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#7cfc00ff>4%<> and extending their attack range.",
        "ult": "When an ally is crowd-controlled or an enemy closes in, allied champions around him heal <#7cfc00ff>150<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#7cfc00ff>50%<>, are <#ef5350ff>immune to crowd control for 1s<> and gain <#ffb900ff>65%<> tenacity for <#ffb900ff>3s<>."
      },
      "league_jayce": {
        "name": "Jayce",
        "attack": "<#ff9028ff>Hextech Capacitor<>: before an attack he switches between hammer (melee) and cannon (ranged) as the fight needs, every <#ffb900ff>6s<> at most, gaining <#ffffffff>25% move speed<>. After turning cannon his next attack cuts the target's <#ffdd8eff>armour and magic resist by 20%<> for <#ffb900ff>5s<>; turning hammer gives him <#ffdd8eff>+25% armour and magic resist<> for <#ffb900ff>4s<>.",
        "skill": "Hammer: leaps at an enemy, dealing <#ff9028ff>90<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>105%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> around him and <#ef5350ff>slowing by 40%<>. <#ff9028ff>Shock Blast<>: fires an orb that bursts on the first enemy hit for <#ff9028ff>100<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>115%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> around it.",
        "skill2": "Hammer: knocks an enemy back for <#a974ffff>40<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, plus <#f5f5f5ff>8% of a champion's max health as true damage<>; on cooldown <#ff9028ff>Lightning Field<> deals <#a974ffff>14<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>12%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> around him every <#ffb900ff>0.5s<>. Cannon: <#ff9028ff>Hyper Charge<> - his next 3 attacks gain <#ceff99ff>120% attack speed<> and deal <#ff9028ff>120%<> AD.",
        "ult": "Turns into the cannon, places the Acceleration Gate (<#ffffffff>40% move speed<> for <#ffb900ff>3s<>) and fires an accelerated orb at a champion: faster and farther, <#ff9028ff>140<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>161%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> in a larger burst."
      },
      "league_katarina": {
        "name": "Katarina",
        "attack": "<#ff9028ff>Voracity<>: when an enemy champion she damaged dies within <#ffb900ff>3s<>, Q and W refresh and Shunpo is ready. Daggers on the ground last <#ffb900ff>4s<>; picking one up slashes nearby enemies for <#a974ffff>138<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>100%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and cuts Shunpo's cooldown to <#ffb900ff>2s<>.",
        "skill": "Throws a bouncing blade for <#a974ffff>150<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>62%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> that bounces to <#ffb900ff>2<> nearby enemies; the dagger lands behind the first target. If <#ff9028ff>Shunpo<> is ready and an enemy champion is near the dagger, she blinks to it.",
        "skill2": "If <#ff9028ff>Shunpo<> is ready she first blinks to an enemy champion for <#a974ffff>75<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>38%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> (cooldown <#ffb900ff>10s<>); then tosses a dagger into the air that lands after <#ffb900ff>1.25s<>, gaining <#ffffffff>60% move speed<> that decays.",
        "ult": "Channels for <#ffb900ff>2.5s<>, throwing daggers at nearby enemy champions for <#a974ffff>650<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>350%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> in total and <#ef5350ff>60% reduced healing<>. Crowd control interrupts it."
      },
      "league_elise": {
        "name": "Elise",
        "attack": "<#ff9028ff>Spider Queen<>: human ability hits gather spiderlings (up to 3). Before each attack she switches between human (ranged) and spider (melee) as the fight needs, every <#ffb900ff>4s<> at most. Spider attacks deal <#a974ffff>20<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>25%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> more and heal her; each spiderling bites for <#a974ffff>12<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>10%<>.",
        "skill": "Human: a venom bolt for <#a974ffff>70<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and <#ffb900ff>3%<> max health true damage. <#ff9028ff>Venomous Bite<>: lunges for <#a974ffff>80<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and <#ffb900ff>5%<> max health true damage.",
        "skill2": "Human: a cocoon for <#a974ffff>60<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> that stuns <#ffb900ff>1.67s<>; on cooldown a <#ff9028ff>Volatile Spiderling<> for <#a974ffff>70<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70%<>. <#ff9028ff>Rappel<>: rises out of reach and drops on a champion; on cooldown <#ff9028ff>Skittering Frenzy<>, +60% attack speed.",
        "ult": "Spits a cocoon at a champion, turns into the spider at once with her spider abilities reset, rappels onto it for <#a974ffff>120<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and bites."
      },
      "league_tahmkench": {
        "name": "Tahm Kench",
        "attack": "<#ff9028ff>An Acquired Taste<>: attacks deal <#a974ffff>30<> + <#a974ffff>2%<> max health <#a974ffff>magic damage<> more; attacks, Q and W stack on champions, up to <#ffb900ff>3<>. <#ff9028ff>Thick Skin<>: 15% less damage taken; surrounded by two enemy champions he gains a <#7dd87dff>160<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#7dd87dff>80%<> shield.",
        "skill": "Lashes his tongue at the first unit hit: <#a974ffff>170<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<> + <#a974ffff>2%<> max health <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and a <#ef5350ff>40% slow<> for <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>. On a champion he heals <#7dd87dff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#7dd87dff>30%<> and adds a stack; at <#ffb900ff>3<> it <#ef5350ff>stuns 1.25s<>.",
        "skill2": "Dives underground for <#ffb900ff>1s<> (untargetable) and bursts up at the target: <#a974ffff>160<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70%<> + <#a974ffff>2%<> max health <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and a <#ef5350ff>1s knock-up<>.",
        "ult": "Swallows an ally caught in crowd control among enemies for <#ffb900ff>2.5s<> and spits him out with a <#7dd87dff>150<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#7dd87dff>100%<> shield; or an enemy champion with <#ffb900ff>3<> stacks for <#ffb900ff>2.5s<>: <#a974ffff>220<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50%<> + <#a974ffff>3%<> max health <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and 6% of its max health as true damage."
      },
      "league_kalista": {
        "name": "Kalista",
        "attack": "Throws spears; each one stays in the enemy it hits for <#ffb900ff>4s<>. <#ff9028ff>Martial Poise<>: she hops back after each spear. <#ff9028ff>Sentinel<>: with an ally beside her target, deals <#ffffffff>14% of its max health as true damage<> (once every <#ffb900ff>5s<>).",
        "skill": "Throws a spear that deals <#ff9028ff>120<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>105%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> to the first enemy hit and sticks a spear in it; if it kills, the spear passes through to the next.",
        "skill2": "Rips out every spear: each deals <#ff9028ff>20<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>50%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> and slows 8%. Killing a champion refunds the cooldown. Rips on its own at <#ffb900ff>3 spears<>.",
        "ult": "Draws an ally beside her into herself for <#ffb900ff>0.5s<>, then hurls them at the target; the landing knocks up nearby enemies for <#ffb900ff>1.25s<> and deals <#ff9028ff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>."
      },
      "league_drmundo": {
        "name": "Dr. Mundo",
        "attack": "<#ff9028ff>Goes Where He Pleases<>: after the first crowd control on him he is immune for <#ffb900ff>1.5s<> and drops a chem-tank; picking it up heals <#7dd87dff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#7dd87dff>60%<>. <#ff9028ff>Blunt Force Trauma<>: every <#ffb900ff>7s<> an attack deals <#ff9028ff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#ff9028ff>8%<> more; a unit it kills is flung, hurting enemies behind it.",
        "skill": "Throws his bone saw at the first unit hit: <#a974ffff>140 magic damage<>, a <#ef5350ff>40% slow<> for <#ffb900ff>2s<> and <#7dd87dff>20<> health back. A champion also takes 9% of its max health as true damage and heals him <#7dd87dff>40<> more.",
        "skill2": "Zaps nearby enemies for <#ffb900ff>4s<> (<#a974ffff>10<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#a974ffff>1%<> every <#ffb900ff>0.33s<>), storing grey health as he is hit. The final zap deals <#a974ffff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#a974ffff>4%<>: hitting a champion heals all the grey health, only minions half.",
        "ult": "Doses himself when cornered: heals <#7dd87dff>200<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#7dd87dff>100%<> at once and for <#ffb900ff>10s<> gains 200 max health, <#7dd87dff>40<> health a second and 25% move speed."
      },
      "league_pantheon": {
        "name": "Pantheon",
        "attack": "Spear thrusts. <#ff9028ff>Mortal Will<>: attacks that land and ability casts each add a stack; at <#ffb900ff>5 stacks<> his next ability is empowered (full at the start of each life). <#ff9028ff>Grand Starfall<> passive: 15% armour penetration.",
        "skill": "Thrusts at a near target, or charges and throws the spear at a far one, dealing <#ff9028ff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> to enemies on the line (a throw: half after the first). Empowered: <#ff9028ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60%<> more.",
        "skill2": "Leaps at an enemy champion, dealing 7% of its max health and <#ef5350ff>stunning it 1s<>; empowered: his next attack strikes 3 times. <#ff9028ff>Aegis Assault<>: raises the shield <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>, immune to crowd control, 60% less damage, stabbing ahead, then bashes for <#ff9028ff>110<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>.",
        "ult": "Crouches <#ffb900ff>1s<>, leaps and falls on enemies in a fight: his spear strikes first for <#ff9028ff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> and a 50% slow, then the landing deals <#a974ffff>300 magic damage<> (half at the edge) and fills Mortal Will."
      },
      "league_orianna": {
        "name": "Orianna",
        "attack": "Fires a clockwork bolt. <#ff9028ff>Clockwork Windup<>: attacks deal <#a974ffff>18<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>15%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> more; attacks within <#ffb900ff>4s<> of each other stack it, up to <#ffb900ff>2<>.",
        "skill": "Throws the Ball at an enemy champion's feet, where it stays, dealing <#a974ffff>85<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>65%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>. <#ff9028ff>Command: Dissonance<>: with enemies near the Ball it pulses by itself for <#a974ffff>85<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>85%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, <#ef5350ff>slowing enemies 30%<> and <#7ee787ff>hasting allies 30%<>.",
        "skill2": "Sends the Ball to the ally nearest the enemy (to herself when an enemy is on her), shielding them for <#7ee787ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#7ee787ff>45%<> and dealing <#a974ffff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>30%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> to enemies on the way. Its holder gains 12 Armor and Magic Resist.",
        "ult": "Waits up to <#ffb900ff>6s<> for an enemy champion near the Ball, then the Ball sends out a shockwave: <#a974ffff>250<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>100%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, enemies <#ef5350ff>flung toward the Ball<>."
      },
      "league_aphelios": {
        "name": "Aphelios",
        "attack": "Fires his main weapon, <#ffb900ff>20 shots<> each, then the next takes its place: <#ff9028ff>Calibrum<> longer range, <#ff9028ff>Severum<> 10% lifesteal and +20% attack speed, <#ff9028ff>Gravitum<> 25% slow, <#ff9028ff>Infernum<> splash, <#ff9028ff>Crescendum<> +5% attack per hit (4s, stacking). <#ff9028ff>The Hitman and the Seer<>: extra growth.",
        "skill": "The main weapon's ability, each on its own cooldown: Calibrum snipes for <#ff9028ff>110<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> and follows up; Severum runs and fires, healing; Gravitum <#ef5350ff>roots<> every enemy it slowed for 1s; Infernum's wave, then off-hand shots; Crescendum a sentry for 5s.",
        "skill2": "Swaps the main and off-hand weapons, only when the main hand's ability is cooling down, the off hand's is ready and an enemy champion is near.",
        "ult": "With 2+ enemy champions round the blast or the target in crowd control, fires moonlight that bursts on the first champion for <#ff9028ff>160<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>120%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>, then by main weapon: Calibrum follow-up shots, Severum heal, Gravitum 90% slow, Infernum more damage, Crescendum 3 chakrams."
      },
      "league_rell": {
        "name": "Rell",
        "attack": "Lance thrusts with <#a974ffff>6 + 1% max health magic damage<>. <#ff9028ff>Break the Mold<>: attacks and abilities that hit a champion take 3% of its armour and magic resist for <#ffb900ff>5s<> and give her 3 of each (stacking).",
        "skill": "Thrusts forward, dealing <#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and <#ef5350ff>stunning 0.65s<> along a line. <#ff9028ff>Full Tilt<>: she and a nearby ally gain 15% then 30% speed; her next attack or Shattering Strike explodes for <#4fc3f7ff>5% of a champion's max health as true damage<>.",
        "skill2": "Leaps onto an enemy champion and crashes down for <#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, <#ef5350ff>knocking up 0.83s<>, gaining a <#4fc3f7ff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#4fc3f7ff>40%<> shield and fighting dismounted for <#ffb900ff>15s<> (resists, attack speed). <#ff9028ff>Mount Up<>: charges on her horse, <#ef5350ff>stunning 0.6s<> and flinging the target.",
        "ult": "Violently pulls nearby enemies to her, then drags them in for <#ffb900ff>2s<> dealing <#a974ffff>280<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>112%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> in all. She waits for 2 enemy champions near her, or one in crowd control."
      },
      "league_reksai": {
        "name": "Rek'Sai",
        "attack": "Claws and bites. <#ff9028ff>Fury of the Xer'Sai<>: attacks and abilities that hit build Fury (4 at most, gone after <#ffb900ff>8s<> out of combat); at full Fury her next bite is <#ff9028ff>Furious Bite<>, <#4fc3f7ff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#4fc3f7ff>110%<> <#4fc3f7ff>true damage<> (every <#ffb900ff>6s<>). Burrowing spends Fury to heal her.",
        "skill": "An enemy beside her: a pounce for <#ff9028ff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>140%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>, +35% attack speed for <#ffb900ff>3s<> and her next 2 attacks splash around (+45% AD). Farther: <#ff9028ff>Prey Seeker<>, a burst of earth in a line for <#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>55%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>.",
        "skill2": "Burrows and tunnels under the target, then <#ff9028ff>Un-burrow<>: <#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>90%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> around her, <#ef5350ff>knocking up 1s<>. She will not tunnel into a crowd of champions with no ally near.",
        "ult": "Only at her <#ff9028ff>Prey<> (champions she has hurt): she goes under for <#ffb900ff>0.9s<> (unseen, immune) and lunges for <#ff9028ff>120<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<> + 15% of its max health <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. Cast on a crowd-controlled target or with an ally on it."
      },
      "league_urgot": {
        "name": "Urgot",
        "attack": "Shotgun blasts from his cannon arm. <#ff9028ff>Echoing Flames<>: attacks and Purge's shots make his leg shotguns take turns blasting a cone at the target for 40% AD + 1% of its max health as <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> (once every 3s, 8s below level 3).",
        "skill": "Fires a charge that explodes where it lands, dealing <#ff9028ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>55%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> and slowing 45%. A hit starts <#ff9028ff>Purge<> for <#ffb900ff>4s<>: his attacks become machine-gun shots of <#ff9028ff>14<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>45%<>.",
        "skill2": "Gains a <#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>40%<> shield and charges an enemy champion: on contact <#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>80%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>, a <#ef5350ff>1s stun<>, and he hurls it behind him, starting <#ff9028ff>Purge<>.",
        "ult": "On his 4th hit in a row on champions, fires a drill that impales the first enemy champion for <#ff9028ff>250<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>50%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> and a slow; after <#ffb900ff>4s<> he reels it in and executes it for 25% of its max health as <#ffffffff>true damage<>. An execution makes nearby enemies <#ef5350ff>flee for 1.5s<>."
      },
      "league_yunara": {
        "name": "Yunara",
        "attack": "Her bead attacks add <#a974ffff>18<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>20%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>. <#ff9028ff>Vow of the First Lands<>: that damage can crit too (base crit <#ffb900ff>10%<>). <#ff9028ff>Cultivation of Spirit<>: attacks build Unleash; when full she gains <#ffb900ff>40%<> attack speed for <#ffb900ff>5s<>, adds <#a974ffff>18<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>20%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and her attacks spread <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>30%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> to nearby enemies.",
        "skill": "Lets rip a spinning bead: <#ff9028ff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>85%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> and a decaying slow to every enemy on its path; it keeps spinning for <#ffb900ff>1s<> where it stops. <#ff9028ff>Transcendent<>: a laser instead, <#ff9028ff>160<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>120%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>.",
        "skill2": "With an enemy champion near, gains <#ffb900ff>40%<> move speed (<#ffb900ff>60%<> when chasing) for <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>. <#ff9028ff>Transcendent<>: dashes back when an enemy champion closes in.",
        "ult": "With 2+ enemy champions near or the target in CC, enters her Transcendent State for <#ffb900ff>15s<>: Cultivation of Spirit stays on, Arc of Judgment becomes a laser, Kanmei's Steps a dash, and both cooldowns drop by 80%."
      },
      "league_swain": {
        "name": "Swain",
        "attack": "A raven bolt from his demon hand. <#ff9028ff>Ravenous Flock<>: Soul Fragments from Vision of Empire, Nevermove's pull and the deaths of champions he hurt heal <#7ee787ff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#7ee787ff>30%<>, +15 max health (lost on death). <#ff9028ff>Vision of Empire<>: every <#ffb900ff>16s<> an eye opens under a far fighting enemy champion, bursting <#ffb900ff>1.5s<> later for <#a974ffff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and a <#ef5350ff>slow<>.",
        "skill": "Five bolts of demonic lightning fan out from his hand for <#a974ffff>120<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>; a close enemy is struck by more of them for <#a974ffff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>45%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> more.",
        "skill2": "A demon hand flies out and back; on its way back it deals <#a974ffff>110<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and <#ef5350ff>roots 1.5s<>. Rooted champions are then pulled closer and drop a Soul Fragment.",
        "ult": "He becomes the demon and drains nearby enemies: every <#ffb900ff>0.5s<> <#a974ffff>25<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>8%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, healing <#7ee787ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#7ee787ff>15%<> per champion; draining champions keeps the form going. After <#ffb900ff>2s<>, <#ff9028ff>Demonflare<>: <#a974ffff>170<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and a <#ef5350ff>slow<>. Cast with 2 enemy champions close, or one with an ally beside him."
      },
      "league_renata": {
        "name": "Renata",
        "attack": "Pistol attacks. <#ff9028ff>Leverage<>: hits on champions deal <#ffb900ff>2%<> of their max health as <#f5f5f5ff>true damage<> and mark them; an ally attacking beside her pops the mark for <#a974ffff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>20%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>. <#ff9028ff>Bailout<>: cast by itself on an ally in crowd control or in a teamfight: +<#ffb900ff>40%<> attack speed, +<#ffb900ff>20%<> move speed, cannot die for <#ffb900ff>5s<>, then heals <#a974ffff>200<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<>.",
        "skill": "Fires a pair of missiles that burst on the first enemy or at the end: <#a974ffff>85<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and a <#ffb900ff>30%<> slow; allied champions they pass get a <#a974ffff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50%<> shield for <#ffb900ff>3s<>.",
        "skill2": "Launches a chemtech hand that grabs the first enemy: <#a974ffff>95<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>85%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and a <#ffb900ff>0.83s<> root, then flings it behind her; enemies where it lands take <#a974ffff>75<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and, if a champion was thrown, a <#ffb900ff>0.5s<> stun.",
        "ult": "With 2+ enemy champions near, or one in crowd control, sends out a chemical wave: enemy champions hit go berserk for <#ffb900ff>1.75s<>, unable to attack her team or cast, lashing out at their own allies every <#ffb900ff>0.5s<> for <#a974ffff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>40%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>."
      },
      "league_nasus": {
        "name": "Nasus",
        "attack": "A staff blow. <#ff9028ff>Soul Eater<>: <#ffb900ff>12%<> life steal. <#ff9028ff>Wither<>: in a fight, every <#ffb900ff>12s<> he ages an enemy champion in the fight for <#ffb900ff>5s<>: a <#ef5350ff>slow growing 35% -> 75%<> and attack speed -25% -> -49%.",
        "skill": "A staff blow for <#ff9028ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> plus <#a974ffff>magic damage<> equal to his stacks. A unit it kills gives <#ffb900ff>4 stacks<>, a champion <#ffb900ff>10<> (lost on death).",
        "skill2": "Spirit fire at the target spot: <#a974ffff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#a974ffff>3%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, then <#a974ffff>10<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#a974ffff>1%<> a second for <#ffb900ff>5s<>; enemies in it lose <#ef5350ff>30% armour<>.",
        "ult": "He grows for <#ffb900ff>15s<>: +300 health, +40 armour and magic resistance, more attack range, Q and E cooldowns halved; the sandstorm deals <#ffffffff>2% of each nearby enemy's max health as true damage<> every <#ffb900ff>0.5s<>. Cast with 2 enemy champions close, or in a fight."
      },
      "league_anivia": {
        "name": "Anivia",
        "attack": "An ice bolt. <#ff9028ff>Rebirth<> (needs the add-on): lethal damage turns her into an egg for <#ffb900ff>6s<>; if the egg survives she is reborn. Cooldown <#ffb900ff>240s<>.",
        "skill": "An ice ball: <#a974ffff>55<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>32%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and a <#ef5350ff>30% slow<> to enemies it passes; it bursts on the first champion or at its spot for <#a974ffff>95<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>65%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and a <#ef5350ff>1.1s stun<>. <#ff9028ff>Crystallize<>: a champion stunned, an ice wall rises there for <#ffb900ff>5s<> that enemies cannot cross.",
        "skill2": "An ice shard for <#a974ffff>75<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>65%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, doubled if the target is crowd controlled or her Glacial Storm has formed.",
        "ult": "A blizzard on an enemy champion for <#ffb900ff>6s<>, growing as it lasts: every <#ffb900ff>0.5s<> <#a974ffff>32<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>13%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and a <#ef5350ff>slow<>, x<#ffb900ff>3<> once formed. Cast on a crowd-controlled champion or with 2 enemy champions near her."
      },
      "league_jarvaniv": {
        "name": "Jarvan IV",
        "attack": "A lance thrust, +20% attack speed. <#ff9028ff>Martial Cadence<>: his first hit on a champion every <#ffb900ff>3s<> deals <#ff9028ff>8% of its max health<> more. <#ff9028ff>Golden Aegis<>: in fights, a shield of <#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>30%<> (+25 per enemy champion near) for <#ffb900ff>4s<> and a <#ef5350ff>25% slow<> to enemies near him.",
        "skill": "Throws his standard for <#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>40%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>; it stands <#ffb900ff>8s<> giving allied champions near it +20% attack speed. From level 3 he then charges to it: enemies on the way and where he lands are <#ef5350ff>knocked up 0.75s<>, take <#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>75%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> and lose 20% armour.",
        "skill2": "A lance thrust down a line: <#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>75%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> and <#ef5350ff>-20% armour<> for <#ffb900ff>3s<>.",
        "ult": "Leaps onto an enemy champion: <#ff9028ff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> around him, and a ring of rock <#ef5350ff>traps enemy champions 3.5s<> - those leaving are pulled back. Cast on a knocked-up enemy or with 2 enemy champions near him."
      },
      "league_ziggs": {
        "name": "Ziggs",
        "attack": "Tosses a small bomb. <#ff9028ff>Short Fuse<>: every <#ffb900ff>12s<> his next attack deals <#a974ffff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> more; each spell he casts takes <#ffb900ff>4s<> off. <#ff9028ff>Satchel Charge<>: from level 3, when an enemy champion closes in, it blows up at his feet for <#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, <#ef5350ff>knocking enemies back<> and blasting him away.",
        "skill": "A bomb that bounces along a line, landing up to <#ffb900ff>3 times<>; it blows up on landing next to an enemy: <#a974ffff>105<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>85%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> around it.",
        "skill2": "Scatters mines for <#ffb900ff>5s<>: an enemy's first mine deals <#a974ffff>65<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>45%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, then 40% of it every <#ffb900ff>0.5s<> it stays; each mine <#ef5350ff>slows 30%<>.",
        "ult": "Hurls a huge bomb at a far enemy champion, its landing spot marked first: <#a974ffff>250<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>85%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> in the blast, <#a974ffff>385<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>130%<> at its centre. Thrown first at champions held by crowd control."
      },
      "league_maokai": {
        "name": "Maokai",
        "attack": "A blow of the huge arm. <#ff9028ff>Sap Magic<>: after his skills hit, his next attack deals <#a974ffff>2% of his max health<> more as magic damage and <#7dd87dff>heals him<> <#a974ffff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<> (once every <#ffb900ff>4s<>). <#ff9028ff>Sapling Toss<>: every <#ffb900ff>10s<> he throws a sapling at an enemy champion; it bursts when an enemy comes near for <#a974ffff>100<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and a <#ef5350ff>35% slow<>.",
        "skill": "Slams the ground: enemies next to him are knocked back and a shockwave deals <#a974ffff>100<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>40%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> plus <#a974ffff>2% of the target's max health<> and a <#ef5350ff>95% slow<> that wears off fast.",
        "skill2": "Dashes to an enemy champion as a mass of roots (no damage or crowd control on the way), then <#ef5350ff>roots it 1.3s<> for <#a974ffff>100<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>40%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>. Cast only with an ally near him or in a fight.",
        "ult": "A wall of brambles slowly advances: enemies it meets take <#a974ffff>180<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>75%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and are <#ef5350ff>rooted 0.8-2.4s<> (longer the farther it went); a champion hit hastes him. Cast with 2 enemy champions near him or in a fight."
      },
      "league_gangplank": {
        "name": "Gangplank",
        "attack": "Cutlass slashes. <#ff9028ff>Trial by Fire<>: every <#ffb900ff>12s<> his next attack or Parrrley sets the target ablaze for <#f5f5f5ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#f5f5f5ff>60%<> <#f5f5f5ff>true damage<> over <#ffb900ff>2.5s<> and speeds him 20%; a Powder Keg blowing up resets it. <#ff9028ff>Remove Scurvy<>: from level 3, when crowd-controlled or crowded he eats an orange: heals <#7dd87dff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#7dd87dff>60%<> and is <#ef5350ff>immune to crowd control<> for <#ffb900ff>1s<>.",
        "skill": "Fires his pistol: <#ff9028ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>, can critically strike, applies Trial by Fire. For <#ffb900ff>1s<> after the hit, every lit Powder Keg with an enemy beside it blows up.",
        "skill2": "Lobs a keg at an enemy champion (up to <#ffb900ff>2<>, lasting <#ffb900ff>8s<>); its fuse is lit after <#ffb900ff>1s<>. A lit keg blows up on Parrrley, his attack next to it or the other keg's blast: <#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> around it (60 more to champions), ignoring 40% armour, <#ef5350ff>slowing 40%<> for <#ffb900ff>2s<>.",
        "ult": "Signals his ship: after <#ffb900ff>1s<> cannonballs rain on an enemy champion's area in <#ffb900ff>12 waves<>, one every <#ffb900ff>0.5s<>, each <#ff9028ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>25%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> and <#ef5350ff>slowing 30%<>. Anywhere on the map, champions held by crowd control first."
      },
      "league_wukong": {
        "name": "Wukong",
        "attack": "Staff strikes. <#ff9028ff>Stone Skin<>: each hit on a champion adds a stack (5 at most): +4 armour and <#66bb6aff>2 health<> a second each. <#ff9028ff>Crushing Blow<>: every <#ffb900ff>4s<> his next attack reaches farther and deals <#ff9028ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>50%<> physical damage more, <#ef5350ff>-20% armour<> on the target for <#ffb900ff>3s<>.",
        "skill": "Dashes to the target on his cloud; images strike it and up to <#ffb900ff>2<> enemies near it for <#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>70%<> physical damage each, then he gains 40% attack speed for <#ffb900ff>5s<>.",
        "skill2": "Turns invisible for <#ffb900ff>1s<> and dashes behind an enemy champion, leaving a clone for <#ffb900ff>4s<>: each second it hits one enemy near it (champions first) for <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>50%<> physical damage, and spins when he does.",
        "ult": "Spins his lengthened staff for <#ffb900ff>2s<>: every <#ffb900ff>0.25s<> <#ff9028ff>10<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>35%<> physical damage plus 2% of a champion's max health; the first hit <#ef5350ff>knocks up for 0.6s<>. A second spin within <#ffb900ff>8s<>. Cast with 2+ enemy champions near, a target in crowd control or right after a dash."
      },
      "league_cassiopeia": {
        "name": "Cassiopeia",
        "attack": "<#ff9028ff>Twin Fang<>: flings a fang for <#a974ffff>18<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>14%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>; within <#ffb900ff>3s<> of her Q or W poisoning an enemy it deals <#a974ffff>14<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>24%<> more and <#66bb6aff>heals her<> <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#66bb6aff>10%<>. <#ff9028ff>Serpentine Grace<>: more move speed per level.",
        "skill": "Blasts the target's spot after <#ffb900ff>0.4s<>, poisoning enemies there for <#ffb900ff>3s<>: <#a974ffff>75<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> in all. Poisoning a champion gives her 45% move speed, fading over <#ffb900ff>3s<>.",
        "skill2": "Releases a poison cloud for <#ffb900ff>5s<>: <#a974ffff>24<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>12%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> a second, <#ef5350ff>50% slow and grounded<> (no dashes) inside.",
        "ult": "Gazes in a cone in front of her: <#a974ffff>160<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>; nearby enemies in the fight are <#ef5350ff>petrified for 2s<>, farther ones <#ef5350ff>slowed 40%<>. Cast with 2+ enemy champions in front or when dived."
      },
      "league_akshan": {
        "name": "Akshan",
        "attack": "Every attack fires two shots, the second dealing 50% to champions. <#ff9028ff>Dirty Fighting<>: every third hit of his attacks and abilities deals <#ff9028ff>20<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>30%<> physical damage more and, on a champion, gives him a <#66bb6aff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#66bb6aff>35%<> shield for <#ffb900ff>2s<>. <#ff9028ff>Going Rogue<>: with 2+ enemy champions near he camouflages for <#ffb900ff>2s<> and gains 40% move speed.",
        "skill": "Throws a boomerang at an enemy (aimed first, so it can be dodged) that deals <#ff9028ff>45<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>90%<> physical damage going out and again coming back; a champion hit gives him 20% move speed for <#ffb900ff>1s<>.",
        "skill2": "Hooks and swings toward an enemy champion: for <#ffb900ff>1.4s<> he shoots the nearest enemy every <#ffb900ff>0.23s<> for <#ff9028ff>25<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60%<> physical damage, then rolls off with a last shot.",
        "ult": "Locks onto a wounded enemy champion and charges for <#ffb900ff>2.5s<>, storing up to 5 bullets (<#ef5350ff>crowd control<> stops it), then fires them: each hits the first enemy in its path for <#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>40%<> physical damage, 30% more for every bullet that hit before."
      },
      "league_poppy": {
        "name": "Poppy",
        "attack": "<#ff9028ff>Iron Ambassador<>: every <#ffb900ff>8s<> her attack throws her buckler from afar for <#a974ffff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>30%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> more; it lands nearby and picking it up gives a <#66bb6aff>120<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#66bb6aff>60%<> <#66bb6aff>shield<>. <#ff9028ff>Steadfast Presence<>: +16% armour and magic resist; with an enemy champion close she gains 40% move speed and for <#ffb900ff>2s<> enemies near her <#ef5350ff>can't dash<>.",
        "skill": "Slams the ground for <#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>70%<> physical damage (+6% max health to champions); the ground <#ef5350ff>slows 25%<> and ruptures again after <#ffb900ff>1s<>.",
        "skill2": "Charges an enemy champion for <#ff9028ff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>80%<> physical damage and carries them; at the end they are <#ef5350ff>stunned 0.75s<>.",
        "ult": "With 2+ enemy champions close she slams the ground: <#ff9028ff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>40%<> physical damage and <#ef5350ff>knock-up 1s<>. Otherwise she charges and swings a shockwave: champions hit take <#ff9028ff>150<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>70%<> physical damage and are <#ef5350ff>knocked far away<>."
      },
      "league_rammus": {
        "name": "Rammus",
        "attack": "A tumbling slam. <#ff9028ff>Spiked Shell<>: attacks deal <#a974ffff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>30%<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#a974ffff>2%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> more. <#ff9028ff>Defensive Ball Curl<>: with an enemy champion close he curls up: for <#ffb900ff>7s<> +60% armour and magic resist, and 25% of the damage he takes is returned.",
        "skill": "Curls into a ball and rolls at the target; on impact nearby enemies take <#a974ffff>110<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>110%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, are <#ef5350ff>knocked back<> and <#ef5350ff>slowed 40%<> for <#ffb900ff>1s<>.",
        "skill2": "<#ef5350ff>Taunts<> an enemy champion for <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>.",
        "ult": "Leaps onto an enemy champion: the area takes <#a974ffff>200<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>90%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and is <#ef5350ff>slowed 40%<>, then 3 aftershocks. Right after a Powerball the centre also takes Powerball's damage and is <#ef5350ff>knocked up 0.75s<>."
      },
      "league_volibear": {
        "name": "Volibear",
        "attack": "<#ff9028ff>The Relentless Storm<>: attacks and spells stack attack speed (6% each, 5); at 5 his attacks loose lightning for <#a974ffff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>40%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>. <#ff9028ff>Frenzied Maul<>: every <#ffb900ff>5s<> an attack becomes a maul for <#ff9028ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>140%<> physical damage and marks a champion; mauling a marked one deals 50% more and heals <#66bb6aff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#66bb6aff>50%<>.",
        "skill": "Rushes at an enemy champion with 40% move speed and pounces for <#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>160%<> physical damage, <#ef5350ff>stunning 1s<>.",
        "skill2": "Calls lightning on an area: after <#ffb900ff>1.5s<> it deals <#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70%<> magic damage (+6% max health to champions) and <#ef5350ff>slows 40%<>; standing in it shields him for <#66bb6aff>120<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#66bb6aff>75%<>.",
        "ult": "Leaps onto an enemy champion: enemies around take <#ff9028ff>200<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>120%<> physical damage and are <#ef5350ff>slowed 50%<>; for <#ffb900ff>12s<> he has +350 health and more attack range."
      },
      "league_zoe": {
        "name": "Zoe",
        "attack": "Throws a little star. <#ff9028ff>More Sparkles!<>: after each spell her next attack deals <#a974ffff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> more.",
        "skill": "Throws a star at the first enemy hit for <#a974ffff>105<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>; the farther it flies the harder it hits, up to <#ffb900ff>250%<>.",
        "skill2": "Kicks a bubble: the enemy champion hit takes <#a974ffff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>40%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, turns <#ef5350ff>drowsy<> (slowed 30%) for <#ffb900ff>1.4s<>, then falls <#ef5350ff>asleep<> for <#ffb900ff>2s<>. A miss leaves it lying as a trap. A sleeper's first star hit deals double.",
        "ult": "Jumps through a portal toward an enemy champion and throws a star for <#a974ffff>200<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>90%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>. <#ff9028ff>Spell Thief<>: 3 missiles follow, <#a974ffff>45<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>15%<> each, and she gains 40% move speed. After <#ffb900ff>1.2s<> she pops back."
      },
      "league_quinn": {
        "name": "Quinn",
        "attack": "<#ff9028ff>Harrier<>: every <#ffb900ff>8s<> Valor marks her target (her spells mark too); her next attack deals <#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60%<> bonus physical damage. <#ff9028ff>Heightened Senses<>: then for <#ffb900ff>2s<> she has +35% attack speed and +25% move speed.",
        "skill": "Valor flies out and bursts on the first enemy: enemies around take <#ff9028ff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>110%<> physical damage; a champion hit is <#ef5350ff>disarmed 0.75s<> and marked.",
        "skill2": "Dashes to an enemy for <#ff9028ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60%<> physical damage, <#ef5350ff>interrupting and slowing it 50%<>, then flips back off it; the target is marked.",
        "ult": "Calls Valor down, rides him at an enemy champion and lands with <#ff9028ff>Skystrike<>: enemies around take <#ff9028ff>170<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<> physical damage and are marked."
      },
      "league_yuumi": {
        "name": "Yuumi",
        "attack": "Fires a page bolt. <#ff9028ff>Feline Friendship<>: every <#ffb900ff>6s<> an attack on a champion deals <#a974ffff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>25%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> more and heals her <#66bb6aff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#66bb6aff>20%<>; the ally she attaches to next is healed as much.",
        "skill": "Fires a missile at the first enemy hit: <#a974ffff>110<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and 20% slow; after <#ffb900ff>0.33s<> of flight <#a974ffff>170<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70%<> and 50% slow instead.",
        "skill2": "<#ff9028ff>You and Me!<>: attaches to an ally in the fight for <#ffb900ff>4s<> (untargetable, moving with him, still casting Prowling Projectile and Final Chapter); he heals <#66bb6aff>45<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#66bb6aff>15%<> a second. <#ff9028ff>Zoomies<>: he gets a <#66bb6aff>130<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#66bb6aff>60%<> shield, +20% attack speed and +10% move speed.",
        "ult": "Opens the book and sends 5 waves: each deals <#a974ffff>110<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>35%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and slows, and heals allies on its way <#66bb6aff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#66bb6aff>10%<>; wave 3 <#ef5350ff>roots<> for <#ffb900ff>1.25s<>."
      },
      "league_chogath": {
        "name": "Cho'Gath",
        "attack": "<#ff9028ff>Carnivore<>: a unit his attack kills heals him <#66bb6aff>35<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#66bb6aff>15%<>. <#ff9028ff>Vorpal Spikes<>: every <#ffb900ff>6s<> his next 3 attacks fire a line of spikes: <#a974ffff>20<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>20%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and a <#ef5350ff>35% slow<> to enemies in it, champions also taking 2% max health true damage.",
        "skill": "Ruptures the ground: after <#ffb900ff>0.6s<> spikes burst out for <#a974ffff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<> magic damage, <#ef5350ff>knocking up 0.75s<> and <#ef5350ff>slowing 60%<>.",
        "skill2": "Screams in a cone ahead: <#a974ffff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50%<> magic damage and <#ef5350ff>silence 1.8s<>.",
        "ult": "Devours a wounded enemy champion: <#ff9028ff>300<> + 5% of his max health as true damage and <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50%<> magic damage through all magic resist. A kill is a stack: +70 max health and a bigger body (no cap; lost on death)."
      },
      "league_karthus": {
        "name": "Karthus",
        "attack": "<#ff9028ff>Wall of Pain<>: every <#ffb900ff>12s<>, with an enemy champion near, his attack raises a wall at that champion for <#ffb900ff>5s<>: enemies in it are <#ef5350ff>slowed 40%<> and lose 20% magic resist for <#ffb900ff>4s<>.",
        "skill": "After <#ffb900ff>0.53s<> the target spot blasts for <#a974ffff>45<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>30%<> magic damage, doubled when it hits a single enemy.",
        "skill2": "For <#ffb900ff>5s<> souls whirl round him, dealing <#a974ffff>10<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>5%<> magic damage to nearby enemies every <#ffb900ff>0.25s<>.",
        "ult": "Channels <#ffb900ff>3s<> (crowd control breaks it), then deals <#a974ffff>200<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>75%<> magic damage to every enemy champion on the map."
      },
      "league_vex": {
        "name": "Vex",
        "attack": "Fires a shadow bolt. <#ff9028ff>Doom<>: every <#ffb900ff>15s<> her next spell <#ef5350ff>fears<> the enemies hit for <#ffb900ff>0.75s<>. <#ff9028ff>Personal Space<>: with an enemy champion close, she instead gains a <#66bb6aff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#66bb6aff>60%<> shield and blasts the enemies around her for <#a974ffff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>40%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> (every <#ffb900ff>12s<>).",
        "skill": "Sends a gust of shadow through every enemy in a line for <#a974ffff>105<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>.",
        "skill2": "Her Shadow flies to the target and spreads: <#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, slowed 35% for <#ffb900ff>2s<>, and <#ff9028ff>Gloom<>: her next spell hit on a Gloomed champion deals <#a974ffff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>30%<> more.",
        "ult": "Fires a missile that marks an enemy champion for <#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>20%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, then surges to it for <#a974ffff>225<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70%<> more."
      },
      "league_zyra": {
        "name": "Zyra",
        "attack": "Flings a thorn seed. <#ff9028ff>Garden of Thorns<>: each Q and E first plants a seed that grows into a plant fighting for <#ffb900ff>5s<>, striking one enemy every <#ffb900ff>1s<> for <#a974ffff>20<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>12%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>.",
        "skill": "Spines burst from the ground, dealing <#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>55%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> to enemies in the area. The seed grows a <#ff9028ff>Thorn Spitter<> that fires from afar.",
        "skill2": "Vines run through the ground, dealing <#a974ffff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>45%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and <#ef5350ff>rooting<> every enemy on the line for <#ffb900ff>1.25s<>. The seed grows a <#ff9028ff>Vine Lasher<> whose short-range strikes slow by 30%.",
        "ult": "Summons a twisted thicket that deals <#a974ffff>180<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and after <#ffb900ff>2s<> <#ef5350ff>knocks up<> the enemies still in it for <#ffb900ff>1s<>. Her plants are enraged for <#ffb900ff>5s<>: 50% more damage."
      },
      "league_graves": {
        "name": "Graves",
        "attack": "His shotgun fires a spread: the target takes <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>110%<>, other enemies in the cone 35% AD; after two shells he reloads for <#ffb900ff>1.33s<>. <#ff9028ff>Smoke Screen<>: every <#ffb900ff>12s<> he also throws a canister at a champion: <#a974ffff>60<> magic damage, <#ef5350ff>50% slow and blind<> for <#ffb900ff>0.5s<>.",
        "skill": "Fires a shell dealing <#ff9028ff>45<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60%<> physical damage to enemies it passes; it lies where it stops and blows up after <#ffb900ff>1s<> for <#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>80%<> physical damage.",
        "skill2": "Dashes (rolls back when an enemy champion is close) and gains a stack of <#ff9028ff>True Grit<> (two with an enemy champion near, up to 4): +7 armour and +5 magic resist each for <#ffb900ff>4s<>, refreshed by his attack hits.",
        "ult": "The recoil knocks him back as he fires a shell that deals <#ff9028ff>120<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>90%<> physical damage to the first enemy champion and explodes, dealing <#ff9028ff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60%<> physical damage around it."
      },
      "league_warwick": {
        "name": "Warwick",
        "attack": "A claw swipe. <#ff9028ff>Eternal Hunger<>: his attacks deal <#a974ffff>20<> bonus magic damage and heal him 8. <#ff9028ff>Blood Hunt<>: hitting a champion gives +30% attack speed and +12% move speed for <#ffb900ff>2s<>.",
        "skill": "Lunges at the target and bites for <#ff9028ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>110%<> + 5% of its max health as physical damage, healing <#ff9028ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>40%<>.",
        "skill2": "Takes 40% less damage for <#ffb900ff>2.5s<>, then howls, making nearby enemies <#ef5350ff>flee<> for <#ffb900ff>1s<>.",
        "ult": "Leaps forward and <#ef5350ff>suppresses<> the first enemy champion hit for <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>, clawing it three times for <#ff9028ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>55%<> physical damage each and healing 40 each."
      },
      "league_gnar": {
        "name": "Gnar",
        "attack": "<#ff9028ff>Rage Gene<>: Mini Gnar's hits build Rage; at full Rage his next action turns him <#ff9028ff>Mega Gnar<> for <#ffb900ff>15s<> (melee, <#ffdd8eff>+40% health, +40% armour and magic resist<>). <#ff9028ff>Hyper<>: every third attack deals <#ff9028ff>20<> + 5% of a champion's max health more and grants <#ffffffff>25% move speed<>.",
        "skill": "Mini: a boomerang flies out and back, each pass dealing <#ff9028ff>30<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>70%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> and <#ef5350ff>slowing 25%<>; caught, its cooldown becomes <#ffb900ff>4s<>. Mega: a boulder stops on the first enemy, dealing <#ff9028ff>60<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>120%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> around it and <#ef5350ff>slowing 40%<>; picked up, its cooldown becomes <#ffb900ff>2s<>.",
        "skill2": "Mini: hops onto an enemy's head and bounces on, dealing <#ff9028ff>40<> + 4% of his max health and <#ef5350ff>slowing<> it. Mega: <#ff9028ff>Crunch<> lands for <#ff9028ff>60<> + 6% of his max health around him; <#ff9028ff>Wallop<> smashes the ground ahead for <#ff9028ff>40<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> and a <#ffb900ff>1.2s<> <#ef5350ff>stun<>.",
        "ult": "Mega Gnar only (Mini Gnar at full Rage transforms first): throws every enemy around him away, dealing <#ff9028ff>170<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>, <#ef5350ff>stunning<> them for <#ffb900ff>1.17s<> and <#ef5350ff>slowing 50%<>."
      },
      "league_sylas": {
        "name": "Sylas",
        "attack": "A chain swing. <#ff9028ff>Petricite Burst<>: each spell he casts stores a charge (2 at most); with one he attacks 40% faster and his next attack whirls his chains round him for <#a974ffff>20<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>35%<> magic damage. <#ff9028ff>Kingslayer<>: every <#ffb900ff>9s<> his attack on a champion becomes a stab for <#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70%<> magic damage, healing <#66bb6aff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#66bb6aff>35%<>.",
        "skill": "Lashes two chains that cross at the target: enemies along them take <#a974ffff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>35%<> magic damage and are slowed 25%; after <#ffb900ff>0.6s<> the crossing explodes for <#a974ffff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>65%<> magic damage.",
        "skill2": "Dashes toward an enemy champion, then throws a chain: the first enemy champion hit takes <#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70%<> magic damage, is <#ef5350ff>knocked up<> for <#ffb900ff>0.5s<> and Sylas pulls himself to it.",
        "ult": "His chain hits an enemy champion, <#ef5350ff>stuns<> it for <#ffb900ff>0.5s<> and steals its ultimate; cast again within <#ffb900ff>10s<> to unleash it at the target: <#a974ffff>200<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80%<> magic damage and nearby enemies <#ef5350ff>knocked up<>."
      },
      "league_mel": {
        "name": "Mel",
        "attack": "A golden bolt. <#ff9028ff>Searing Brilliance<>: each ability adds 3 bolts to her next attack (up to 9), each dealing <#a974ffff>12<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>5%<> magic damage; hitting a champion applies <#ff9028ff>Overwhelm<>. <#ff9028ff>Rebuttal<>: every <#ffb900ff>25s<>, her first champion hit raises a barrier for <#ffb900ff>1.25s<>: 50% less damage taken, 40% reflected, +25% move speed.",
        "skill": "Bolts rain on the target's spot and burst <#ffb900ff>6 times<>, each dealing <#a974ffff>22<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>15%<> magic damage to enemies there.",
        "skill2": "Fires a radiant orb: enemies at its centre take <#a974ffff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50%<> magic damage and are <#ef5350ff>rooted<> for <#ffb900ff>1s<>; those around it are slowed 30% and burn for <#a974ffff>10<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>6%<> x4 over <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>.",
        "ult": "Strikes every enemy champion marked with <#ff9028ff>Overwhelm<>, however far: <#a974ffff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>8%<> magic damage per stack."
      },
      "league_velkoz": {
        "name": "Vel'Koz",
        "attack": "Fires void energy. Every third attack opens a <#ff9028ff>Void Rift<>: <#a974ffff>35<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>20%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, then it detonates for <#a974ffff>55<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>25%<>. <#ff9028ff>Organic Deconstruction<>: spell hits on champions stack; the third deals <#f5f5f5ff>45<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#f5f5f5ff>45%<> <#f5f5f5ff>true damage<>.",
        "skill": "Shoots a bolt of plasma that deals <#a974ffff>85<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>65%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and slows by 50% for <#ffb900ff>1.25s<>. On hit it splits in two, dealing <#a974ffff>45<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>35%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and the slow to nearby enemies.",
        "skill2": "Causes an area to explode, dealing <#a974ffff>75<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>40%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and <#ef5350ff>knocking up<> enemies for <#ffb900ff>0.75s<>.",
        "ult": "Channels a beam for <#ffb900ff>2.5s<> that deals <#a974ffff>320<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>105%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> in total. Champions researched by <#ff9028ff>Organic Deconstruction<> take <#f5f5f5ff>true damage<> instead."
      },
      "league_ornn": {
        "name": "Ornn",
        "attack": "<#ff9028ff>Living Forge<>: +10% armour and magic resist, +6% health. W, E and R make enemy champions <#ff9028ff>Brittle<>; his attack on a Brittle champion deals <#ffffffff>8% of its max health<> as true damage and <#ef5350ff>knocks it up<>. <#ff9028ff>Bellows Breath<>: every <#ffb900ff>12s<> he breathes fire, <#ef5350ff>unstoppable<> and shielded, dealing <#a974ffff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#a974ffff>5%<> magic damage.",
        "skill": "Slams the ground: a fissure deals <#ff9028ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<> physical damage and <#ef5350ff>slows 40%<>; a magma pillar rises at its end for <#ffb900ff>4s<>.",
        "skill2": "Charges the target, dealing <#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#ff9028ff>4%<> physical damage. Charging into a pillar shatters it: enemies around are <#ef5350ff>knocked up<> for <#ffb900ff>1s<> and take <#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#ff9028ff>3%<> physical damage, champions made Brittle.",
        "ult": "Summons a fire ram that charges back to him, dealing <#a974ffff>120<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#a974ffff>3%<> magic damage and <#ef5350ff>slowing 50%<>; when it reaches him he headbutts it back, dealing <#a974ffff>120<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#a974ffff>3%<> magic damage and <#ef5350ff>knocking up<> along its path."
      },
      "league_shyvana": {
        "name": "Shyvana",
        "attack": "A strike that also deals 1% of the target's max health as physical damage. <#ff9028ff>Inferno Aegis<>: every <#ffb900ff>12s<> an attack gives her a <#ff9028ff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>50%<> shield and +25% move speed; after <#ffb900ff>2.5s<> the flames explode for <#a974ffff>50 + 4% of her max health<> magic damage.",
        "skill": "Slashes ahead for <#ff9028ff>25<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>110%<> physical damage. Within <#ffb900ff>4s<> her next attack sweeps around her for <#ff9028ff>25<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>110%<>; as a dragon the one after bites for <#f5f5f5ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#f5f5f5ff>110%<> true damage.",
        "skill2": "Hurls a fireball that bursts on the first enemy or at its end for <#a974ffff>50 + 3% of her max health<> magic damage, slowing by 30% for <#ffb900ff>2s<>. As a dragon it is bigger, passes through enemies and leaves the ground burning.",
        "ult": "With full <#ff9028ff>Dragon Fury<> she becomes a dragon and flies at an enemy champion breathing fire: <#a974ffff>100 + 4% of her max health<> magic damage and <#ef5350ff>fear<> for <#ffb900ff>0.75s<>. The dragon lasts <#ffb900ff>15s<> with +30% health; <#ff9028ff>Scalemail<> gives +30% armour and magic resist."
      },
      "league_naafiri": {
        "name": "Naafiri",
        "attack": "A lunging bite. <#ff9028ff>We Are More<>: every attack and ability hit, her pack bites too for <#ff9028ff>8<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>12%<> physical damage (half to non-champions).",
        "skill": "Hurls a dagger for <#ff9028ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>25%<> physical damage and a bleed of <#ff9028ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>45%<> over <#ffb900ff>5s<>; her pack leaps on a champion hit and mauls it for <#ffb900ff>3s<>. Within <#ffb900ff>4s<> her next attack hurls the second dagger for <#ff9028ff>35<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>55%<>, healing her <#7bd96bff>35<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#7bd96bff>30%<> on a champion.",
        "skill2": "Dashes onto the target and shreds the enemies around her twice for <#ff9028ff>35<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>50%<> and <#ff9028ff>25<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>40%<> physical damage.",
        "ult": "<#ff9028ff>The Call of the Pack<>: untargetable for <#ffb900ff>0.75s<>, for <#ffb900ff>5s<> a pack twice as big, +20% attack and +20% move speed. Then she pounces on an enemy champion for <#ff9028ff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>65%<> physical damage, a <#ef5350ff>slow<> and -20% armour. A takedown within <#ffb900ff>7s<> lets her pounce once more with a <#7bd96bff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#7bd96bff>40%<> shield."
      },
      "league_heimerdinger": {
        "name": "Heimerdinger",
        "attack": "Fires a hextech bolt. <#ff9028ff>Hextech Micro-Rockets<>: every third attack also fires 5 rockets, each dealing <#a974ffff>10<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>7%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>.",
        "skill": "Sets down a turret (up to 3) for <#ffb900ff>10s<> that strikes one enemy every <#ffb900ff>0.83s<> for <#a974ffff>6<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>4%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, or beams a crowd-controlled champion for <#a974ffff>18<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>14%<>. <#ff9028ff>Hextech Affinity<>: +20% move speed near his turrets.",
        "skill2": "Throws a grenade that deals <#a974ffff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>45%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and slows by 35%; enemies at its centre are <#ef5350ff>stunned<> for <#ffb900ff>1s<>.",
        "ult": "UPGRADE! Against a crowd: three empowered grenades, each <#a974ffff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>35%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and a <#ffb900ff>1s<> <#ef5350ff>stun<>. Otherwise: an apex turret for <#ffb900ff>8s<>, every <#ffb900ff>0.5s<> <#a974ffff>18<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>10%<> and a 25% slow."
      },
      "league_neeko": {
        "name": "Neeko",
        "attack": "Fires a magic bolt. <#ff9028ff>Shapesplitter<>: every third attack deals <#a974ffff>45<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50%<> bonus <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and grants 30% move speed for <#ffb900ff>1s<>.",
        "skill": "Throws a seed that bursts for <#a974ffff>95<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>65%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>. If it hits a champion it blooms again, up to twice, for <#a974ffff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>25%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> each.",
        "skill2": "Flings a piercing tangle of barbs, dealing <#a974ffff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and <#ef5350ff>rooting<> every enemy on the line for <#ffb900ff>1s<>. Champions past the first are rooted <#ffb900ff>0.75s<> longer.",
        "ult": "Charges for <#ffb900ff>0.75s<> behind a <#66bb6aff>shield<> (40 more per nearby enemy champion), then leaps, <#ef5350ff>knocking up<> enemies around her, and lands for <#a974ffff>260<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>115%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, <#ef5350ff>stunning<> them for <#ffb900ff>0.83s<>."
      },
      "league_ksante": {
        "name": "K'Sante",
        "attack": "A heavy ntofo strike. <#ff9028ff>Dauntless Instinct<>: after his abilities hit, his next attack deals <#ff9028ff>15<> + 2% of the target's max health bonus physical damage.",
        "skill": "Strikes the ground ahead for <#ff9028ff>35<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>70%<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#ff9028ff>2%<> physical damage, slowing 50%. Each hit is a stack; at two the strike becomes a shockwave that <#ef5350ff>pulls<> enemies in for <#ff9028ff>55<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>70%<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#ff9028ff>3%<> physical damage.",
        "skill2": "Braces, taking 25% less damage behind a <#66bb6aff>shield<>, then rams for <#ff9028ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60%<> + 6% of each target's max health physical damage, <#ef5350ff>knocking back<> and <#ef5350ff>stunning<> for <#ffb900ff>0.83s<>. All Out: no knockback or stun, 9% instead.",
        "ult": "Bashes an enemy champion for <#ff9028ff>100<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>80%<> physical damage, <#ef5350ff>knocking it back<>, then slams it for <#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60%<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#ff9028ff>4%<>. He goes All Out for <#ffb900ff>15s<>: +20% attack, +40% attack speed, <#66bb6aff>20% lifesteal<>, shorter cooldowns, -25% armor and magic resist."
      },
      "league_udyr": {
        "name": "Udyr",
        "attack": "A punch. <#ff9028ff>Bridge Between<>: after each ability his next two attacks gain +30% attack speed. <#ff9028ff>Iron Mantle<>: his first ability every <#ffb900ff>12s<> also shields him for <#7bd96bff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#7bd96bff>40%<> and his next two attacks heal him <#7bd96bff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#7bd96bff>20%<> each.",
        "skill": "Bear stance: +30% attack speed for <#ffb900ff>4s<> and his next two attacks deal <#ff9028ff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>35%<> + 4% of the target's max health more. Awakened (cast in the Bear stance): +60% attack speed and both attacks call lightning for <#a974ffff>25<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#a974ffff>35%<> magic damage around the target.",
        "skill2": "Ram stance: +35% move speed, he charges an enemy champion and rams it for <#ff9028ff>25<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<> physical damage, <#ef5350ff>stunning<> it for <#ffb900ff>0.75s<>. Awakened (cast in the Ram stance): +60% move speed and immune to crowd control for <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>.",
        "ult": "Phoenix stance: a glacial storm whirls round him for <#ffb900ff>4s<>, every <#ffb900ff>0.5s<> dealing <#a974ffff>18<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#a974ffff>22%<> magic damage to nearby enemies and <#ef5350ff>slowing<> them 25%; at its end the storm is unleashed at an enemy champion for <#a974ffff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#a974ffff>60%<> magic damage and a 40% slow."
      },
      "league_qiyana": {
        "name": "Qiyana",
        "attack": "A swing of her ring blade. <#ff9028ff>Royal Privilege<>: her first hit every <#ffb900ff>4s<> deals <#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>50%<> physical damage more. While her ring holds an element she has +25% attack speed and her attacks deal <#a974ffff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#a974ffff>25%<> magic damage more.",
        "skill": "Sweeps the ring through the enemies before her for <#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>110%<> physical damage. With an element she spends it: river <#ef5350ff>roots<> for <#ffb900ff>0.5s<> then slows 25%; rock deals <#ff9028ff>25<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>40%<> more; grass camouflages her for <#ffb900ff>2.5s<> with +25% move speed.",
        "skill2": "Dashes onto an enemy for <#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>70%<> physical damage. <#ff9028ff>Terrashape<>: the dash enchants her ring with an element (grass, river and rock in turn) and refreshes Edge of Ixtal.",
        "ult": "Swings the ring and sends a shockwave that deals <#ff9028ff>120<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>120%<> physical damage to the enemies on its way, <#ef5350ff>knocking them back<> and <#ef5350ff>stunning<> them for <#ffb900ff>0.9s<>."
      },
      "league_hwei": {
        "name": "Hwei",
        "attack": "A flick of ink. <#ff9028ff>Signature of the Visionary<>: a champion hit by his ability and hit again within <#ffb900ff>4s<> takes <#a974ffff>45<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>35%<> magic damage. <#ff9028ff>Subject: Serenity<>: painting Disaster gives him +25% move speed; painting Torment <#66bb6aff>shields<> him and the allies near for <#a974ffff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>35%<>.",
        "skill": "Paints by the situation: <#ff9028ff>Severing Bolt<> on a crowd-controlled champion, <#a974ffff>70<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>45%<> plus <#a974ffff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<>; else <#ff9028ff>Devastating Fire<> at a champion, <#a974ffff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<> plus 3% of its max health; with no champion near, <#ff9028ff>Molten Fissure<>, lava that burns and slows 35%. All magic damage.",
        "skill2": "Paints by the situation: <#ff9028ff>Grim Visage<> makes a champion on top of him <#ef5350ff>flee<> for <#ffb900ff>1s<>; else in turn <#ff9028ff>Gaze of the Abyss<> (an eye that <#ef5350ff>roots<> for <#ffb900ff>1.3s<>) and <#ff9028ff>Crushing Maw<> (jaws that hold and slow 45%). Each deals <#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50%<> magic damage.",
        "ult": "Flings paint at a champion: a canvas spreads under it for <#ffb900ff>3s<>, burning and slowing the enemies on it 25%, then bursts for <#a974ffff>220<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>100%<> magic damage."
      },
      "league_ivern": {
        "name": "Ivern",
        "attack": "Throws a seed. <#ff9028ff>Brushmaker<>: each Triggerseed grows a brush at his feet for <#ffb900ff>4s<>; allies in it gain +15% attack and his own attacks deal <#a974ffff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>15%<> magic damage more.",
        "skill": "Plants a seed on the ally beside him (else on himself): a <#66bb6aff>shield<> of <#a974ffff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>45%<> that bursts after <#ffb900ff>2s<>, dealing <#a974ffff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50%<> magic damage to the enemies around and slowing them 50%.",
        "skill2": "Lashes out a vine: <#a974ffff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50%<> magic damage and a <#ef5350ff>root<> for <#ffb900ff>1.25s<>; the allies beside him rush in with +35% move speed.",
        "ult": "Calls <#ff9028ff>Daisy<> down on an enemy champion: a <#ef5350ff>knock-up<> and <#a974ffff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>40%<> magic damage, then a punch every second for <#ffb900ff>8s<> (<#a974ffff>25<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>20%<>), every third a slam for <#a974ffff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>30%<> more that <#ef5350ff>knocks up<>."
      },
      "league_illaoi": {
        "name": "Illaoi",
        "attack": "Swings her idol down. <#ff9028ff>Prophet of an Elder God<>: an attack grows a tentacle before her every <#ffb900ff>6s<> for <#ffb900ff>6s<>; it strikes an enemy nearby every <#ffb900ff>1.5s<> for <#ff9028ff>10<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>35%<> physical damage, and <#66bb6aff>heals<> her <#ff9028ff>6<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>6%<> when it hits a champion.",
        "skill": "Leaps at her target: <#ff9028ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>50%<> + 2% of its max health as physical damage, and every tentacle of hers lashes it.",
        "skill2": "Rips the spirit out of an enemy champion for <#ffb900ff>5s<>: it takes 15% more damage and is <#ef5350ff>slowed<> 50%; then it is a Vessel for <#ffb900ff>4s<> and a tentacle grows by it.",
        "ult": "Leaps and smashes her idol into the ground: <#ff9028ff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60%<> physical damage to the enemies around, a tentacle for each champion hit; for <#ffb900ff>8s<> her tentacles strike every <#ffb900ff>1s<> and the cooldown of Harsh Lesson is <#ffb900ff>2s<>."
      },
      "league_aurora": {
        "name": "Aurora",
        "attack": "A spirit bolt off her wand. <#ff9028ff>Spirit Abjuration<>: her hits on champions add up; the third exorcises a spirit for <#a974ffff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>30%<> + 2% of the target's max health, and it <#66bb6aff>heals<> her <#a974ffff>45<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>15%<> and speeds her up. <#ff9028ff>Across the Veil<>: with an enemy champion on top of her, she hops back, invisible for <#ffb900ff>1.25s<> and 30% faster (once every <#ffb900ff>20s<>).",
        "skill": "A hex flies through her enemies for <#a974ffff>100<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>55%<> magic damage, cursing them; <#ffb900ff>0.67s<> later the curses are drawn back, dealing <#a974ffff>100<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>55%<> magic damage on the way home.",
        "skill2": "A blast of spirit magic before her: <#a974ffff>150<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80%<> magic damage and a <#ef5350ff>slow<> of 60% that fades; then she hops back.",
        "ult": "Leaps onto an enemy champion: the shockwave deals <#a974ffff>260<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80%<> magic damage and <#ef5350ff>slows<> 40%; a realm opens for <#ffb900ff>3.5s<>, <#ef5350ff>slowing<> the enemies in it 30%, and she steps across it after her target when it walks away."
      },
      "league_nunu": {
        "name": "Nunu & Willump",
        "attack": "Claw swipe. Every 3rd attack is <#ff9028ff>Consume<>: <#a974ffff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50%<> more magic damage (120 true damage more to minions and monsters) and <#66bb6aff>heals<> <#a974ffff>25<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>25%<>; then for <#ffb900ff>4s<> they and an ally gain 30% attack speed and 15% move speed, and attacks splash 20% around.",
        "skill": "Rolls a snowball into the target: <#a974ffff>55<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>42%<> magic damage and a <#ef5350ff>knock-up<> of <#ffb900ff>0.5s<>; the longer it rolls the bigger it grows, up to 170% damage and a <#ffb900ff>1s<> <#ef5350ff>knock-up<>.",
        "skill2": "Throws 6 snowballs, each dealing <#a974ffff>11<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>7%<> magic damage and <#ef5350ff>slowing<> 30%; then the champions hit are <#ef5350ff>rooted<> for <#ffb900ff>0.75s<> and take <#a974ffff>25<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>30%<> magic damage.",
        "ult": "Channels a blizzard for <#ffb900ff>2.5s<> under a <#66bb6aff>shield<> of <#a974ffff>120<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80%<>, <#ef5350ff>slowing<> nearby enemies 40% rising to 80%; at the end it bursts for <#a974ffff>190<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>105%<> magic damage (a broken channel bursts for the share channelled)."
      },
      "league_azir": {
        "name": "Azir",
        "attack": "<#ff9028ff>Arise!<>: every <#ffb900ff>2.5s<> his attack raises a sand soldier at the target (<#ffb900ff>3<> at most, <#ffb900ff>8s<>); his soldiers stab for him, <#a974ffff>75<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>100%<> magic damage. With none in reach he shoots a sand bolt himself.",
        "skill": "Every soldier charges at the target, <#a974ffff>110<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>65%<> magic damage on the way and a 25% <#ef5350ff>slow<>; they stab at once on arrival. With none standing, one rises there.",
        "skill2": "Only with a soldier up: a shield of <#66bb6aff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#66bb6aff>60%<>, then, with his ultimate ready, a dash onto an enemy champion for <#a974ffff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>55%<> magic damage and one more soldier. Dived by a champion, he hops back instead.",
        "ult": "A wall of guards charges out: <#a974ffff>260<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>90%<> magic damage and <#ef5350ff>knocks back<> the enemies. Right after Shifting Sands onto a champion he steps behind it first and drives it toward his team."
      },
      "league_zac": {
        "name": "Zac",
        "attack": "A goo punch. <#ff9028ff>Unstable Matter<>: when ready, an attack bursts for <#a974ffff>25<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>30%<> magic damage round him, champions also taking <#e0e0e0ff>4% of their max health<> true damage (cooldown <#ffb900ff>5s<>). <#ff9028ff>Cell Division<>: skills hitting a champion shed a blob; absorbing it <#66bb6aff>heals<> <#a974ffff>55<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>15%<> (the revive needs the add-on).",
        "skill": "Stretches an arm at the target for <#a974ffff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>30%<> + 2% of his max health magic damage, <#ef5350ff>slowing<> 40%; a champion caught is flung to him after <#ffb900ff>0.4s<> and slammed for the same damage again, <#ef5350ff>knocking up<> enemies round him for <#ffb900ff>0.5s<>.",
        "skill2": "Charges for <#ffb900ff>0.6s<>, then flings himself at the target, landing for <#a974ffff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<> + 3% of his max health magic damage and a <#ffb900ff>0.5s<> <#ef5350ff>knock-up<> round him.",
        "ult": "Bounces 4 times, unstoppable: each landing deals <#a974ffff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50%<> magic damage (the later ones 50%), a <#ffb900ff>0.33s<> <#ef5350ff>knock-up<> and a 25% <#ef5350ff>slow<>."
      },
      "league_singed": {
        "name": "Singed",
        "attack": "A blow of his plate. <#ff9028ff>Poison Trail<>: he leaves poison clouds behind him (<#ffb900ff>3s<>); enemies in them take <#a974ffff>18<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>18%<> magic damage every <#ffb900ff>0.5s<>. <#ff9028ff>Noxious Slipstream<>: passing an enemy champion gives him 25% move speed for <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>.",
        "skill": "Flings the target over his shoulder to behind him: <#a974ffff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60%<> magic damage and <#e0e0e0ff>5% of its max health<> true damage. While his <#ff9028ff>Mega Adhesive<> lies on the ground, the target is <#ef5350ff>rooted<> for <#ffb900ff>1s<>.",
        "skill2": "Throws a vial of glue: for <#ffb900ff>3s<> enemies in it are <#ef5350ff>slowed<> 50% and <#ef5350ff>grounded<> (no dashes).",
        "ult": "Drinks the potion: for <#ffb900ff>25s<> +60 ability power, +30 armor and magic resistance, +15% move speed and <#66bb6aff>12 health<> a second; <#ff9028ff>Poison Trail<> grows, deals 150% and inflicts <#ef5350ff>Grievous Wounds<> (-40% healing)."
      }
    },
